<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Ndamba Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">LUKASI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chilongu ngimu wuchiyandikiwili na Lukasi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lukasi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">CHILONGU CHA NYANYI CHIYANDIKIWILI NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKASI</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGULELU</para>
  <para style="ip">Chilongu ngimu wayandikili Lukasi ndi chimu gati ya fitabu mchechi fya lilaghanu lya shonu yifihimulila ngalilu ya Yesu Kilistu. Kila chitabu chimu chikukemiwa “Injili,” mana yaki ndi “chilongu cha nyanyi.” Fiyandikiwa na Mateyi na Maliku na Lukasi na Yohani pasovili Yesu. Lukasi ayandikili milandu ya ngalilu ya Yesu hela ha, lakini wuwula wula ayandikili milandu yivagolili vandundami va Yesu pasovili na pashukukili, muchitabu chivachikema Figoli fya Vandundami. Kwahela mundu yamanyili nakaka chipindi chilongu ngimu wayandikili Lukasi chayandikiwili awu chiyandikiwa koti, lakini yivapwembukili vatangalili vakujumila kucha pamongapa chiyandikiwa mumyaka milongu saba kukandila pawonikili Yesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yayandikili chitabu ndi Lukasi mweni aveli mganga. Ndambu ya nyandikilu yaki na ndambu ya ng'ombelu yaki ya filongu yikulangusha mweni mundu yapwembukili. Lukasi adayileyi ayandiki chamanyili nakaka mungalilu ya Yesu, pawomba ndambu milandu ngimu wuyifumbukili, ili vangi vaweshi kumanya pavasoma chitabu Lukasi 1:1-3. Mweni aveli Muyawudi ha Vakolosayi 4:10-14 na ayandikili kwa ndambu kucha vangutungu va Vayawudi vakuwesha kumanya. Ayi yikuwoneka lipala kwa ndambu yahimulili fishovi fya Vayawudi Lukasi 1:8.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chilongu Cha Nyanyi cha yandikili Lukasi chiyifwana munu na chitabu cha Mateyi na Maliku, kwanongwa fikuhimulila chindu chichila kwa ndambu yiyila. Gati ya fitabu fitatu, Lukasi akulangusha milandu yitangalili nendu kumwilata Yohana mbatisha. Lukasi wuwula wula akuvilishili kwilata upomelu sula ya 3:3, 11:4, 17:3-4, 23:34, 24:47 na kudadava sula 3:21,5:16, 6:12, 11:1-12, 22:32.</para>
  <para style="iot">Fivelili mugati kwa chikata</para>
  <para style="io">Lukasi akuchimanyisha chilongu chaki na akuhimulila kwanongwa liki achiyandikili sula ya1:1-4</para>
  <para style="io">Pambeli akuhimulila kuwoneka kwa Yesu na ndambu yatandiwili kwa ngimbaniku sula ya 1:5-4:13.</para>
  <para style="io">Kwa mwambu mkomi wusighalili wa chilongu sula ya 4:14-21:38, Lukasi akuwomba kwilata figoli nendu miwujawuja yagolili Yesu na findu fyawulili.</para>
  <para style="io">Pambeli musula mbili sha kumalilila 22-24, kahimulila ndambu Yesu wasovili na wavamsikili na washukukili kula kwa yivasovili.</para>
  <para style="io">Kushukuka, kuvafumbukila vandu na kutoliwa kumbindi kwa Bambu Yesu. Sula ya 24:1-53</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mkomi Teofili,</para>
  <para style="p">Vandu vatangalili vayesha fivaweshili kuyandika findu yifibwitukili pagati ya yufwi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yivayandikili vatuwombilili na vafitovilela findu afi kukandila pafikandilili na vandumindumi va Chilongu cha Nyanyi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Topi, mkomi Teofili, kwanongwa nembesha findu afi kwa chiganu kukandila pafikandili, ng'ona nyanyi nguyandikili kwa fisingu findu afi yifibwitukili. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ili muweshi kumanya nakaka kwilata findu fila fimuwuliwili.</para>
  <para style="s">Kutunga kuwoneka kwa Yohani Mbatisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Majuva vala Helodi paghaveyi mutwa wa Uyawudi, kwaveli na mtambika yumoyu, litawa lyaki Sakaliya, wa chipinga cha vatambika cha Abiya. Mdamundu afumili mulukolu lwa Haluni, litawa lyaki Elisabeti. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Vosi vavili vaveli vanyanyi na vagolili findu fimunowishili Chapanga kwa kukamula Malawu vosi va Bambu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Vaveli na mwana ha, kwanongwa Elisabeti aveli muwumba. Vosi vavili vaveli vagogolu munu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lijuva limu, Sakaliya aveli akugola chichuku chaki cha kutambika munyumba ya Chapanga, kucha chishovi chaki chipindi cha kuyanga chichuku chaki. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kucha pachiveli chishovi cha vatambika, do yamponikilili Sakaliya kuyenda munyumba ya Bambu kututumisha ubani, topi kayingila. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Chipindi patutumisheyi ubani, vandu vosi vaveli panji pavamdadavili Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Makungu wa Bambu kamubwitukila, kawoloka mwambu wa mlilu wa pala pa fyalu vya kututumishila ubani. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Sakaliya pamwonili makungu kasisima, chipwembu chimwingila. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lakini makungu kamuwombela, “Kotoo kutila Sakaliya! Chapanga kapikanila kudadava kwaku. Mdawaku Elisabeti dakuleleli mwana mlumi na yuwi dawumukemi litawa lyaki Yohani mbatisha. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Na yuwi dawuvi na seku nendu na dausekeleli na vandu vatangalili davavi na seku kwa kuwoneka kwaki! <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kwa hoshu sha Bambu daghavi mundu mkomi. Dalandi ha difwayi wala chindu chochosi cha kulovela. Mfuki Mng'alili damumemi kufuma munda ya mamundu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mweni davajoveshi vandu vatangalili va Isilaeli na Bambu wawu Chapanga. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Damuwombeli Bambu, kandi daghavi na mfuki na liwovi kucha Eliya mbuyi wa Chapanga. Davajoveshi pamu kandi vatati na vana, davawuyishi vandu vaveli na lukilu vavi na hoshu sha nyanyi kucha vandu vampikanisha Chapanga, davagoli vandu vayitandili kumuyanga Bambu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Sakaliya amudashili makungu, “Dandivi na chiganu liki kwa afi? Nenga gogola nahau na mdala wangu kagogola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Makungu kayangula, “Nenga Gabulieli ndumindumi wa Chapanga, ndi yandumili nyisi kavawombela achi chilongu cha nyanyi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kujumila ng'odu filongu fyangu, ponopa dawuvi ngadeta, mbaka lijuva lila afi dafigoleki na dafibwituki kwa chipindi chaki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Na vandu vala vamvetileyi Sakaliya vakayikang'anikeyi, “Mbona kayikala nendu mula munyumba ya Chapanga?” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pafumili panji kalemwa kudeta nawu vandu vala, akalangusheyi kwa mawoku hela na vandu vakacheyi Chapanga kamlangusha chindu paghaveyi munyumba ya Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Chipindi cha kuyanga kugola chichuku cha kunyumba ya Chapanga payipelili, kawuya kayaki. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pambeli Elisabeti mdala wa Sakaliya kapata yinda ayikalili pakaya myesi muhanu, kayidetela, <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Ponopa Bambu kang'onela lusungu, kang'ushila soni shangu kwa vandu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kuwoneka kwa Yesu kulanduliwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mwesi wa sita wa yinda ya Elisabeti, Chapanga kamulayisha Gabulieli makungu ayendi Nasaleti mumbwani ya Galilaya. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Avelili na filongu fya kumuwombela mdadala muyenji litawa lyaki Maliya, nondi ya Yosefu, wa lukolu lwa Mutwa Dawudi. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Makungu kamuyendela na kumujambusha, “Hawije! Bambu kava na yuwi, kakugayila usangi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Maliya papikanishili filongu fya makungu kasisima munu kayihola, “Filongu afi fina mana liki?” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Makungu kamuwombela, “Kotoo kutila Maliya, Chapanga kakugayila usangi. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Daumleli mwana mlulumi na yuwi dawumkemi litawa lyaki Yesu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mweni daghavi mkomi na dakemiwi mwana wa Chapanga Mkomi, Bambu Chapanga damugoli ghavi Mutwa kucha Dawudi mbuyi mundu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Daghavi mutwa wa lukolu lwa Yakobi jola na wutwa waki daupeli ng'odu!” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Maliya amdashili makungu, “Milandu ayi dayivi wuliwuli, kunu nenga ngalihela kutang'ana na mlumi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Makungu kamuyangula, “Mfuki Mng'alili dakusunukili na liwovi lya Chapanga mkomi dalikugubiki kucha lisisi, ponopa mwana ang'alili dawoneki dakemiwi, mwana wa Chapanga. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Loli, hata Elisabeti mlongu waku vandu vadetili aweshi ha kulela, ponopa kana yinda ya myesi sita na mweni mgogolu nawula. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kwa hela chindu Chapanga chalemwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Maliya kayangula, “Nenga ndumindumi wa Bambu, chigoleki kwa nenga nga wudetili.” Pambeli yula makungu kawuka.</para>
  <para style="s">Maliya akumtyangila Elisabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Majuva vavala vala, Maliya kawopa mwanja kalopokesha mbaka luvagha lumolu luvelili kufidunda fya Yudeya, <verse number="40" style="v"/>aku ayingilili munyumba ya Sakaliya na kumujambusha Elisabeti. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Elisabeti papikanishili jambushilu ya Maliya, mwana chali ajumbili mumunda yaki. Elisabeti amemili Mfuki Mng'alili. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Elisabeti kadeta kwa lishu likomi, kunemeliwa kupita vadala vosi na mwana dawumleli kanemiliwa. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Nengapa ghani mbaka mawu waki Bambu wangu kayisa kundyangila kayangu? <verse number="44" style="v"/>Ngukuwombela, pambikanishili paudeta, mwana chali mumunda yangu kalilimuka kwa seku. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Nakaka kunemeliwa kwanongwa kujumila fila Bambu fyakuwombilili dafigoleki.</para>
  <para style="s">Lumbombu lwa Maliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Maliya kadeta,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ndima yangu yikumjuma Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>mundima yangu mukusekelela kwanongwa ya Chapanga mlowola wa nenga.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Kang'onela lusungu nenga ndumindumi waki mshisha moyu,</para>
  <para style="q">kufumila ponopa, vandu vosi davangemi muna seku.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa Chapanga muna liwovi kagolela milandu mikomi,</para>
  <para style="q">litawa lyaki ling'alili.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Akuvalangushila vandu lusungu kufuma lukolu mbaka lukolu,</para>
  <para style="q">kwa vandu yivamtila Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Kagola milandu mikomi kwa liwoku lyaki.</para>
  <para style="q">Kavavinga vaveli na lukilu pamu na hoshu shawu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Kavasunusha vatwa vaveli na liwovi mufigoda fyawu</para>
  <para style="q">kavakwelesha vayidedikili.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Vaveli na njala kavakutisha findu finofu,</para>
  <para style="q">valundamali kavawusha mawoku hela.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Kamtanga Isilaeli ndumindumi waki, payihola lusungu lwaki,</para>
  <para style="q">payihola lusungu lwaki,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Ngimu wavawombilili vavaha vetu Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="q">na fileli fyaki jola!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v"/>Maliya ayikalili na Elisabeti kwa myesi mitatu, pambeli kawuya kaya yaki.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuwoneka kwa Yohani Mbatisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Chipindi cha kulela Elisabeti chafikili, kamlela mwana mlumi. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Vajofi na valongu mundu pavapikanishili kucha Chapanga kamulangusha lusungu lwaki lukomi, wosi vasekelela pamu na mweni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Mwana paghaveyi na lijuma limu, vayisa kumudumula jandu. Vakadayileyi kumkema Sakaliya, litawa lya tati mundu. <verse number="60" style="v"/>Kumbi mamundu adetili, “Ng'odu, litawa lyaki datumkemi Yohani mbatisha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Vala vamuwombela, “Mbona kwahela mundu mulukolu lwenu yavelili na litawa ali?” <verse number="62" style="v"/>Topi vamkupisha tati mundu, ili vamdashi akadayileyi mwana waki vamkemi litawa liki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v"/>Mweni kavaluva chibawu ayandiki, kayandika naha, “Litawa lyaki Yohani mbatisha.” Vosi vayikanganika. <verse number="64" style="v"/>Bahala pala, mlomu na lulimi lwaki Sakaliya fifuwuka, kakanda kuywanga pamjuma Chapanga. <verse number="65" style="v"/>Lyogha livayingila vandu vosi va pabehi yaki milandu ayi yikwila kosi kula kufidunda fya Yudeya. <verse number="66" style="v"/>Vapikanishili milandu ayi, vayihola mundima shawu, pavadeta, “Mwana ayu daghavi mundu wa wuliwuli?” Kucha nakaka liwovi lya Bambu Chapanga naliva pamu na mweni.</para>
  <para style="s">Lumbombu lwa Sakaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v"/>Sakaliya tati mundu Yohani kamema Mfuki Mng'alili, kadeta umbuyi awu kufuma kwa Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v"/>Tumujumi Bambu, Chapanga wa Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="q">loli kavayisila na kuvakombola vandu vaki.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v"/>Katugayila wakutugombola yagangamalili,</para>
  <para style="q">mulukolu lwa Dawudi ndumindumi waki.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>Ajangili kukandila dahili kwa deha ya vambuyi vaki vang'alili.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>Kucha akutugombola mumawoko va vachimdwama vetu</para>
  <para style="q">na kufuma mumawoku va vosi yivavelili na maya na yufwi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v"/>Adetili davavawoneli lusungu vagogolu vetu</para>
  <para style="q">na kulikumbuka lilaghanu lyaki ling'alili.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v"/>kwilapa kwayilapili kamwilapila Ibulahimu mbuyi wetu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v"/>Kadeta, datugomboli mumawoku va vachimdwama vetu,</para>
  <para style="q">tupati kumtundamila ngajila kuva na lyova.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v"/>Tuvi vang'alili na vandu goleki</para>
  <para style="q">majuva vosi va kuyikala mumlima.</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v"/>“Yuwi mwana wa nenga davakukemi,</para>
  <para style="q">mbuyi wa Chapanga mkomi,</para>
  <para style="q">dawumulonguleli Bambu Chapanga kumvendela deha yaki.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v"/>Dawuvawombeli vandu kucha davagombolewi</para>
  <para style="q">kwa kuvawushila sambi shawu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v"/>Chapanga wetu mshishamoyu na muna lusungu</para>
  <para style="q">datumulikili na limbamba kufuma kumbindi kwa Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v"/>Davang'alikili vosi vayikala mulwisa totolu,</para>
  <para style="q">ayongeshi mawulu vetu tuyifikili deha ya kusika.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v"/>Mwana akulili, mvili na ndima. Ayikalili kuchivala mbaka lijuva payilangushili lipala kwa vandu va Isilaeli.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kuwoneka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 1:18-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Majuva vala Agustini Mutwa wa Loma alayishili vandu vosi va wutwa wa Loma vavalangiwi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ayi yaveli mwanja mtasi kwa vandu kuvalangiwa chipindi Koneli paghaveyi mkomi wa mlima wa Siliya. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ndamboyi vandu vonda vayendili kuyandikisha matawa vawu, kila mundu kayaki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yosefu kafuma mbwani ya Nasaleti, kumlima wa Galilaya, kayenda mbwani ya Betelehemu, kumlima wa Yudeya, pawonikilili mutwa Dawudi. Yosefu ayendili kula kwanongwa mweni aveli wa mulukolu lwa Dawudi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ayendili kuyandikiwa pamu na nondi waki Maliya, yavelili kana suliya. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Maliya paghaveyi kula, lijuva lyaki lya kwiwopola lyafikili. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kayihongesha mwana soli mlumi, kamfwalisha fisepi. Pambeli kamwonjesha muligeleli, mulibaku lya kulila vasenga, kwanongwa vapatili ha libudi lya vahenja.</para>
  <para style="s">Vadima na Makungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mumlima wula kwaveli na vadima vasenga vayikalili kuchivala pamihi pavadima vasenga vawu kwa lutonu.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="02 Shepherds.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="2:8">Vadimi</figure> <verse number="9" style="v"/>Tepu, Makungu wa Bambu kavabwitukila, bwitu! Na ukomi wa Bambu wuvang'alikila mwambu wosi nawu vatila nendu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Makungu kavawombela, “Mkotoo kutila! Nguvayeghela filongu fya nyanyi na fya sekuseku kwa vandu vosi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nalelu muluvagha lwa Dawudi kawoneka mlowola kwanongwa yenu, ayu ndi Kilistu na Bambu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Achi dachivi chilangushilu, Damumuwoni mwana chali vamfwalisha fisepi, kawonjeshwa muligeleli, mulibaku lya kulila vasenga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Teputepu lipinga likomi lya Makungu kufuma kumbindi kwa Chapanga vayihasha pamu na yula makungu, vamjuma Chapanga, vakadeteyi,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Ukomi kwa Chapanga yaveli kumbindi nendu,</para>
  <para style="q">na kusika mumlima kwa vandu vala vamunowesha Chapanga!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Vala makungu pavawukili kuwuya kumbindi kwa Chapanga, vadimasenga vawombana, “Tuyendi Betelehemu tukachiwoni chila chifumbukili, chila chatuwombilili Bambu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Topi vayenda mbilu, vavawona Maliya na Yosefu na yula mwana chali kawonjeshwa mulibaku lya kulila vasenga. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Pavamuwonili yula mwana, vavawombela Maliya na Yosefu chila makungu chavawombilili kwanongwa ya mwana. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Vosi yivapikanili filongu fila fivadetili vadimasenga, vayikanganikili nendu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Maliya akumbukili filongu fyosi afi na kuyihola nendu mana yaki mumunda. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Vala vadimasenga vawuya kuchivala, pavamukwisha na kumujuma Chapanga kwa findu fyosi fyavapikanilili na kufiwona, fyosi fyavelili kucha Makungu avawombilili.</para>
  <para style="s">Mwana vamugayila litawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lyapitili lijuma limu, chipindi cha mwana kumwingisha jandu chafikili, vamkema litawa lyaki Yesu, litawa ali amupili makungu chipindi Maliya akalihela kuva na suliya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuyeghiwa Munyumba ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Majuva pavafikili va Yosefu na Maliya vadayiliwili kupugiwa ngimu Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa wuvadeta. Vamtola na mwana wawu vamyegha Yelusalemu, kumvika kwa Bambu Chapanga, <verse number="23" style="v"/>yiyandikiwa Mumalawu va Bambu, “Mwana yoyosi soli mlumi akudayiliwa atawuliwi kwa Chapanga.” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kandi vakayendili kula kuyegha litambiku lya vangunda vavili na myoni mivili ya vangulaku ngimu vadetili Mumalawu va Bambu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Chipindi chila mumbwani ya Yelusalemu, avelili mundu yumu, litawa lyaki Simoni. Mundoyu aveli akumunowesha Chapanga, mweni aveli akuvetela ukombola wa Isilaeli. Mfuki Mng'alili aveli pamu na mweni. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mfuki Mng'alili amulayilili, dasovi ng'odu mbaka ndimuwoni Kilistu, mkombola yashawuliwili na Chapanga. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mfuki Mng'alili kamlongosha Simoni kuyingila mungengileka ya Nyumba ya kudadavila. Maliya na Yosefu pavamyeghili mwana Yesu vamgoleli ngimu yiyandikilwi muchitabu cha Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa, <verse number="28" style="v"/>Simoni amuyangili Yesu mumawoku vaki na kumjuma Chapanga, padeta:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Ponopa Bambu yiva ngimu wudetili,</para>
  <para style="q">uneki ndumindumi waku nzovi kwa kusika,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>mesu vangu vawuwona ulowolu waku,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>wuwutandili paulongolu ya vandu vosi,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Alu lwengi lwa kulangusha chiwudayila yuwi kwa vangajila kujumila</para>
  <para style="q2">na kuyegha ukomi kwa vandu vaku va Isilaeli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Tati na mamundu Yesu vavelili vakujingwa na filongu fyadetili Simoni fya mwana. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Simoni kavanemela na kamuwombela Maliya, mamundu Yesu, “Mwana ayu kashawuliwa na Chapanga kuvawisha vandu vatangalili va Isilaeli na kuyegha ukombola wa vandu vatangalili va Isilaeli. Daghavi chilangushilu kufuma kwa Chapanga, ila vandu vatangalili davamlemi. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Na dayivi fyavayihola mundima sha vandu vatangalili dafigubutuliwi. Na wumweni, lihingili likali kucha chimayi dachisomi mundima yaku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kwaveli na mbuyi yumu mdala, agogulili munu, litawa lyaki Ana biti Fanuweli, wa lukolu lwa Asheli. Mdala ayu ayikalili na bambu mundu kwa myaka saba kufumila pahetiwili. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Pambeli kayikala wungalimlyangu mbaka chipindi chila pavelili mgogolu wa myaka milongo minani na mchechi. Chipindi chosi ayikalili Munyumba ya Chapanga, payikaja kulya kunu padadava. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Saa yiyila mdala yula kafumbuka, kamhongesha Chapanga na kuvawombela milandu ya mwana yula kwa vandu vosi vaveteleyi kukombuliwa kwa Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuwuya Nasaleti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yosefu pamu na Maliya pavamalishili kugola fyosi ngimu Malawu va Bambu wuvadeta, vawuya kayawu Nasaleti, mumlima wa Galilaya. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mwana yula kakula, kayongesheka liwovi na kamema luhunja na usangi wa Chapanga yiva pamu na mweni.</para>
  <para style="s">Msongolu Yesu Munyumba ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Valeli va Yesu vaveli na chishovi cha kuyenda Yelusalemu kila mwaka, chipindi cha lihungu lya Pasaka. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu paghaveyi na myaka lilongu na mivili, vosi vayenda kulihungu lila lya Pasaka ngimu wuchivelili chishovi chawu. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Lihungu palipitili, vakanda kuwuya kayawu. Lakini msongolu Yesu asighalili Yelusalemu, ngajila kumanya valeli vaki, <verse number="44" style="v"/>vakacheyi kava mulipinga lya vandu, vayendayenda lijuva lyosi. Pambeli vakanda kumsaka kwa vajofi na vaghanja vawu. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Pavampotili kumuwona, vawuya Yelusalemu kumsaka. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Mulijuva lya tatu, vamuwona mungengileka ya Nyumba ya Chapanga, kayikala na vawula va Chiyawudi, pavapikanisha kunu akuvanasha minasha. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Vosi yivamupikanishili vayikanganikili nendu luhala lwaki na nyangulilu yaki yaluhunja. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Valeli vaki pavamuwonili, vajinga. Mau waki kamdasha, “Mwana wangu, wuli, ukutugolela liki nahawu? Nenga na tati waku tukakusakeyi kwa kuyifwasha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Mukunzakila liki? Mukamanyeyi ng'odu kucha ngudayiliwa kuyikala munyumba ya Tati wangu?” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Lakini valeli vaki vamanya ha filongu fyavawombileyi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu pamu na valeli vaki vawuya Nasaleti na mweni pavayitikila. Na mawu waki avikilili milandu yosi munda yaki. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Yesu kayendelela kukula mvili na luhunja na kwa kumunowesha Chapanga pamu na vandu wuwowu.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kulandula kwa Yohani Mbatisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mwaka wa lilongu na muhanu Mutwa Tibeliu patavaleyi, Ponsiu Pilatu paghavaya mtavala wa boma lya Yudeya. Helodi aveli mtavala wa Galilaya na mlongu mundu Filipu aveli akutavala mahali patavaleyi Ituleya na Talakoniti. Lusania aveli mtavala wa Abileni, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Anasi na Kayafa vaveli vagolafichuku wa vakomi va nyumba ya kudadavila, chipindi chila, filongu fya Chapanga pafimfikilili Yohani mbatisha mwana wa Sakaliya, kula kuchivala. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Topi Yohani kayenda ngengeleka yosi ya lweni Yoludani. Kavawomba vandu vapomeli na kabatishiwa ili Chapanga avawushili sambi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Afi ndi fivayandikiwili muchitabu cha Isaya yaveli mbuyi wa Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="q">“Mundu yumu akukema kucheja.</para>
  <para style="q">‘Mumtandili deha Bambu,</para>
  <para style="q">na muhololi deha yaki.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pa libosi mukulili,</para>
  <para style="q">pa fidunda na midunda musengelemuli,</para>
  <para style="q">njila sivelili na ngombu dasihololiwi.</para>
  <para style="q">Deha sha wafu wafu dasigoleki nyanyi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Vandu vosi davamuwoni Chapanga akuvalowola vandu!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lipinga lya vandu lyafikili kwa Yohani ili avabatishi, Yohani kavawombela, “Yumwi vana va njoka! Ghani kavapwepwela mtuvi maya va Chapanga davayisi ava? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mlangushi kwa golelu kucha mupomela, mukotoo kukanda kuyiwombela mwaveni kucha, ‘Ibulahimu ndi tati wetu.’ Nguvawombela nakaka, Chapanga akuwesha kuyigola migonguveli ayi yivi vana va Ibulahimu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Livawu liva kala kudumula mikigha ya mibiki, ndamboyi kila libiki lingajila kuveleka fivelekwa fya nyanyi dalidumuliwi na kuliyasila mumotu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lipinga lya vandu limdasha, “Ponopa yufwi tugoli liki?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kavayangula, “Yaveli na gwanda mbili yimu amupi yula yangajila gwanda, yavelili na filivi agoli ngawuwula.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Vala vasumula mbiya vayisa na veni vabatishiwa vamdasha, “Muwula, tugoli liki?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mweni kavawombela, “Mkotoo kusumula mbiya kujumba chigelu chila chivavikili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Machonda wuwu vamdasha, “Na yufwi tugoli liki?”</para>
  <para style="p">Kavayangula, “Mkotoo kutola findu fya mundu yoyosi kwa liwovi wala kumpayishila yoyosi. Mujakwi na ijala yenu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Vandu vaveli vakushuvilila chindu chiutunga, vakanda kuyidasha mundima shawu chimwilatili Yohani mbatisha kucha mweni kava ndi Kilistu yashawuliwili na Chapanga. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Apa Yohani mbatisha kavawombela vosi, “Nenga nguvabatisha kwa machi, ila akwisa yaveli na liwovi pitu nenga, mweni nenga nguwesha ha hata kuwoposola ng'oyi sha mikobasi yaki, mweni davabatishi kwa Mfuki Mng'alili na kwa motu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mweni kana luselu mumawoku vaki na mweni dafyayili luvagha lwaki lwa kupetela mpunga dawuviki mulusanja myeyu danyanyi mumotu wa lifumbika.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwa filongu kafwauti Yohani avalandulilili vandu chilongu cha nyanyi na kuvakayika vaghalambuli ngalilu shawu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yohani amshoshili mutwa Helodi, yula yamtolili Helodiya mdala wa mlongu mundu, kwanongwa ya kumgola mdala mundu, pamu na findu fyosi fya wafu fyagolili. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pambeli Helodi kagola chindu chawafu munu kumuwopa Yohani mbatisha muchijaka.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akubatishiwa</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 3:13-17, Maliku 1:9-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Vandu vosi pavabatishiwili kala, Yesu na mweni kabatishiwa. Padadaveyi, kumbindi kwa Chapanga kufuwuka. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Na Mfuki Mng'alili kamsunukila kucha njiva. Pambeli lishu lipikanika kufuma kumbindi kwa Chapanga, “Yuwi mwana wangu yingutamili, mayiliwa na yuwi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lukolu lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 1:1-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu pakandili chichuku chaki, aveli na myaka milongu mitatu, vandu vakacheyi mweni mwana wa Yosefu, mwisukulu wa Heli. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Heli aveli mwana wa Matati na ayu aveli mwana wa Lawi na ayu aveli mwana wa Meliki na ayu aveli mwana wa Yanai na ayu aveli mwana wa Yosefu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yosefu aveli mwana wa Matatia na ayu aveli mwana wa Amosi na ayu aveli mwana wa Nahumu na ayu aveli mwana wa Hesili na ayu aveli mwana wa Nagai, <verse number="26" style="v"/>avelili mwana wa Mateyi na ayu aveli mwana wa Matatia na ayu aveli mwana wa Shefungami na ayu aveli mwana wa Yoseki na ayu aveli mwana wa Yuda, <verse number="27" style="v"/>ayu aveli mwana wa Yohani, na ayu aveli mwana wa Lesi na ayu aveli mwana wa Zelubabeli na ayu aveli mwana wa shealitieli na ayu aveli mwana wa Neli, <verse number="28" style="v"/>na ayu aveli mwana wa Meliki na ayu aveli mwana wa Adi na ayu aveli mwana wa Kosamu, avelili mwana wa Elimadamu na ayu aveli mwana wa Eli, <verse number="29" style="v"/>na ayu avelili mwana wa Yoshua na ayu aveli mwana wa Eliezeli na ayu aveli mwana wa Yolimu na ayu aveli mwana wa Matati na ayu aveli Mwana wa Lawi, <verse number="30" style="v"/>ayu avelili mwana wa Simoni na ayu aveli mwana wa Yuda na ayu aveli mwana wa Yosefu na ayu aveli mwana wa Yonamu na ayu aveli mwana wa Eliyakimu, <verse number="31" style="v"/>ayu avelili mwana wa Melea na ayu aveli mwana wa Mena na ayu aveli Mwana wa Matata na ayu aveli mwana wa Natani na ayu aveli mwana wa Dawudi, <verse number="32" style="v"/>ayu avelili mwana wa Yesi na ayu aveli mwana wa Obedi na ayu aveli mwana wa Boasi na ayu aveli mwana wa Solumoni na ayu aveli mwana wa Nashoni, <verse number="33" style="v"/>ayu avelili mwana wa Aminadabu na ayu aveli mwana wa Adimini na ayu mwana wa Alini na ayu mwana wa Hesilomi na ayu aveli mwana wa Pelesi na ayu aveli mwana wa Yuda, <verse number="34" style="v"/>ayu avelili mwana wa Yakobi na ayu aveli mwana wa Isaka na ayu aveli mwana wa Ibulahimu na ayu aveli mwana wa Tela na ayu aveli mwana wa Naholi, <verse number="35" style="v"/>ayu avelili mwana wa Selugi na ayu aveli mwana wa Leu na ayu aveli mwana wa Pelegi na ayu aveli mwana wa Ebelina na ayu aveli mwana wa Sala, <verse number="36" style="v"/>ayu avelili mwana wa Kainamu na ayu aveli mwana wa Alifakisadi na ayu aveli mwana wa Shemu na ayu aveli mwana wa Nuhu na ayu aveli mwana wa Lameki, <verse number="37" style="v"/>ayu avelili mwana wa Metusela na ayu aveli mwana wa Inoki na ayu aveli mwana wa Yaledi na ayu aveli mwana wa Mahalaleli na ayu aveli Mwana wa Kainamu, <verse number="38" style="v"/>ayu avelili mwana wa Enoshi na ayu aveli mwana wa Seti na ayu aveli mwana wa Adamu, aveli wa Chapanga.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu Kayeshiwa</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 4:1-11, Maliku 1:12-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kawuka lweni Yoludani amemili Mfuki Mng'alili, Mfuki Mng'alili kamlongosha kucheja. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Aku kayeshiwa na Lijangavandu kwa majuva milongu mchechi. Chipindi chila chosi, kalya chindu ha na pavapitili majuva vala njala yamtamili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Topi Mwafu kamuwombela, “Kucha yuwi kuva mwana wa Chapanga, uliwombeli ligonguveli ali livi libumunda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu kamuyangula, “Mayandiku vakuwomba, ‘Mundu akwikala kwa kulya chilivi weka hela ha.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pambeli Lijangavandu kamtola mbaka pambindi, tepu kamulangusha wutwa shonda sha mumlima. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lijangavandu kamuwombela, “Dandikugayili uwesu na ukomi muwutwa na findu afi fyosi, fyanyimbili na nenga nguwesha kumugayila mundu yoyosi yindimudayila. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Afi fyosi dafivi fyaku, kucha pawundundamila nenga”.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu kamuyangula, “Yiyandikiwa mumayandiku, ‘Umtundamili Chapanga waku na umkimbanikili mweni weka hela!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lijangavandu kamtola Yesu mbaka Yelusalemu pambindi ya nyumba ya Chapanga na kamuwombela, “Kucha yuwi Mwana wa Chapanga, widangi pasi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Liyandikiwa, ‘Chapanga dalayilili makungu vaki vakuyangi.’ <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kandi, ‘Davakuyangi mumawoku vawu, ukotoo kuponikela mumigonguveli.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kamuyangula, “Mayandiku vakudeta, ‘Kotoo kumuyesha Chapanga Bambu waku.’”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lijangavandu palimuyeshili kala kwa deha shosi pambeli limleka mbaka chipindi chijumiliwi pachifika.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akukanda chichuku chaki aku Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 4:12-17, Maliku 1:14-15</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu kawuya Galilaya kufuma kucheja kamema liwovi lya Mfuki Mng'alili, milandu yaki yikwila mbembu shosi sha pabehi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mweni aveli akuwula munyumba sha kudadavila, pajumiwa na vandu vosi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vakumlema aku Nasaleti</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 4:12-17, Maliku 6:1-6</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Topi Yesu ayendili Nasaleti, pala pakulilili na Lijuva lya Kupumulila, ayingilili munyumba ya kudadavila kucha washovililili, awolukili kusoma filongu fya nyanyi kwa lishu likomi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kapokela chitabu cha mbuyi wa Chapanga Isaya, kagubutula na kapasoma pavayandikili:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Mfuki wa Bambu kava na nenga,</para>
  <para style="q">kan'shagha mafuta.</para>
  <para style="q">Nivayegheli vagaju filongu fya nyanyi.</para>
  <para style="q">Kanayisha ndivalandulili vandu vakoliwili na Lijangavandu vapekesuki,</para>
  <para style="q">na vangalimesu mesu valoli kandi,</para>
  <para style="q">kanayisha nivagomboli vala vawopiwili vafuwuliwi,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>na kulandula chipindi chifika</para>
  <para style="q">cha Chapanga kuvalowola vandu vaki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu pasomili kala, achigubikili chila chitabu, kamgayila ndumindumi, pambeli kayikala pasi, vandu vosi yivavelili munyumba ya kudadavila vamfulutulila mesu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mweni kuvawombela, “Lyandiku ali nalelu liva ngimu wumupikanishili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Vosi vanovelwa nendu na mweni, vakayikang'anikeyi filongu fya nyanyi fyadetili. Vadeta, “Ayu mwana wa Yosefu nda?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mweni kavawombela, “Nakaka damung'ombeli detelu ayi, ‘Mwilwana ayilowoli mweni.’ Na damdeti, ‘Fyosi fitupikinishili fiwugolili kula Kapelinaumu, ufigoli kandi apa paluvagha yaku.’ <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nguvawombela naha,” kayendelela kudeta, “Mbuyi akujumiliwa ng'odu pamulima waki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Mpikanishi! Nakaka pavavelili vangalimlyangu vatangalili mlima wa Isilaeli chipindi cha Eliya. Chipindi achi ndonya yalekili kutonya kwa myaka mitatu na myesi sita, kwavelili na njala ngomi mlima wosi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hata naha, Eliya kalayiliwa ng'odu kwa yoyosi yula, ila kwa mdala yaveli ngalimlyangu wa Salefati aku Sidoni. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kandi, kumlima wa Isilaeli Chipindi cha Mbuyi wa Chapanga Elisha pavelili na vandu vatangalili vavelili na ukalava. Hata naha, kwa hela yoyosi vang'alili ila Namani mwenikaya wa mlima wa Siliya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Vosi vavelili mula munyumba ya kudadavila pavapikanishili fila vakalalili munu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Vawoloka, vamfumisha panji ya mbwani yawu yivajengili kufidunda, vamyegha mbaka mungwaji ya chidunda achi ili vamdangili pasi. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kapita pagati yawu, kayenda.</para>
  <para style="s">Mundu yavelili na chinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 1:21-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kayenda Kapelinaumu boma ya Galilaya, kavawula vandu Mulijuva lya Kupumulila. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Vakayikang'anikeyi fyawuleyi nongwa akafundisheyi kwa uwesu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mula munyumba ya kudadavila mwavelili mundu yamkwelili chinyamkela akalalili, akawuteyi kwa lishu likomi, <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Yayooo! Kuva na liki na yufwi, yuwi Yesu wa Nasaleti? Wuli kwisa kutumalila? Ngumanya yuwi kwa ghani, yuwi kuva Mng'alili wa Chapanga!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu akumlakalila yula Chinyamkela, padeta, “Matu! Umfumi mundu ayu!” Chinyamkela yula amfumili pamuwishili mundu yula pasi, afumili ngajila kumugobola.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Vandu vosi vayikanganika vakawombaneyi veni, “Achi chindu liki chadeta? Nongwa kwa uwesu na liwovi, kavawombela finyamkela vafumi na veni vakufuma!” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Milandu ya Yesu yipikanika mwambu wula wosi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalowola vandu vatangalili</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 8:14-17, Maliku 1:29-34</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu afumili mula munyumba ya kudadavila, kayenda kaya ya Simoni. Nafyala mundu Simoni, avelili na mususa, vamuluva amulowoli. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu kayisa kawoloka pabehi yaki, kawulakalila msusa wula, weni wumleka. Mau yula bahala pala katandamuka kavakimbanikila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Lijuva palidibeyi, vosi vakaveli na vatami vawu vavayeghili kwa mweni, akavavikilili mawoku vaki, kavalowola vosi. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Finyamkela vakavafumili vandu vatangalili, vakawuteyi pavadeta, “Yuwi ndi mwana wa Chapanga!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kavalakalila finyamkela, wala kuvajumisha ng'odu kudeta, nongwa vamanyili aveli Kilistu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvawombela kula Yudeya</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 1:35-39</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Chilawu yaki pamalavila, Yesu awukili ayendili kuyififa. Vandu vaveli vakumsaka. Vandu vala pavafikili pavelili, vayeshili kumkanisha akotoo kuwuka. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Lakini mweni avawombilili, “Ngudayila kuvawombela Chilongu cha Nyanyi cha wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga milima yimonga wuwu, ndi Chapanga wanayishili kwanongwa ayi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Aveli akuvalandulila munyumba sha kudadavila shosi kula Yudeya.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvakema vandundami va pakwandi</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 4:18-22, Maliku 1:16-20</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lijuva limu, Yesu aveli kawoloka muluwongu ya lihiva lya Genesaleti, vandu vatangalili vaveli vamushengitela na kuyikekeneka, vakupikanisha chilongu cha Chapanga. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kavawona matu mavili mung'emula ya lihiva. Valovi veni vajabukili, vakusambula njafu shawu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Payingilili muwatu wumu wa Simoni, Yesu akamuluveyi Simoni awuseleshi kumachi, kutali padokwa na ng'emula ya lihiva. Kayikala pasi, akuwula lipinga lya vandu paghaveyi muwatu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pamalili kuwula, kamuwombela Simoni, “Soli watu awu mbaka pamachi matali, mukadangi njafu shenu muwomeshi vasomba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Simoni kamuyangula, “Bambu tuyifwasha kutegha njafu pamii posi tupata chindu ha, leki pawudeta yuwi datuyasilili njafu.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pambeli pavagolili kala, vawomesha vasomba vatangalili hata njafu sikakandeyi kudumuka. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Vavakema vayawu vavelili muwatu wingi vayisi kuvatanga. Vayisa, vamemesha vasomba matu vosi mavili, hata vakacheyi vadibali. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Simoni Petili pawonili nawula, kamtundamila Yesu kadeta, wuki pawushu panenga, yuwi Chapanga, nenga muna sambi!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Simoni pamu na vamonga vosi vakayikang'anikeyi munu kupata vasomba vatangalili nawula. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Wuwula wula Yakobi na Yohani, vana va Sebidayu, vaveli valova vayaki Simoni. Yesu kamuwombela Simoni, “Kotoo kutila, kukandila ponopa dawuvi mufuva vandu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Topi, pavapayikili matu mung'emula ya lihiva, vafilekili findu fyawu fyosi, vamkovikela Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlowola muna ukalava</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 8:1-4, Maliku 1:40-45</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu paveli mbwani yimu yaveli na mundu yumoyu yavelili na ukalava mvili wosi. Pamuwonili Yesu, mweni kamuwila pasi kamluva, “Bambu, pawudayila, ukuwesha kung'ofuwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwolushela liwoku lyaki na kumkamula padeta, “Ngudayila! Ung'ali!” Tepu ukalava wula uwuka. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Kotoo kumuwombela mundu yoyosi, ila ukayilangushi kwa mgolafichuku wa nyumba ya kudadavila, uyeghi fupu ya kupugiwa umweni, kucha walayishili Musa, ukatovileli kucha kulowoka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Topi, milandu ya Yesu yikwila mwambu wosi. Lipinga lya vandu vatangalili liyikungasha kumpikanisha na kulowuliwa matami vawu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mweni ayendili pangajila vandu, aku akadadaveyi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlowola mundu yapombalili</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 9:1-8, Maliku 2:1-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lijuva limu, Yesu avelili pawula. Mafwalisayu na vawula va Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa kufuma kila luvagha Mugalilaya na Muyudeya na Muyelusalemu, vaveli vayikala. Liwovi lya Bambu lyaveli pamu na mweni lya kulowola valwalili. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Tepu vandu vayisa, vamuyegha mundu yumu yapombalili muluhagha, vayesha kumuyingisha munyumba, paulongolu pa Yesu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lakini, kwanongwa ya lipinga lya vandu, valemwili kwingila munyumba. Topi, vakwela kumbindi ya lituvili liveli ligalamu, vakwemula midasi, vampenesha yula yapombalili pamu na ulili waki vamvikili paulongolu ya Yesu.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="17 Lowering Man Through the Roof.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="5:19">Vandu vampenesha mundu mulituvili</figure></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu pawonili ujumilwa wawu mkomi, amuwombilili mundu yula, “Ghanja, ngupomela sambi shaku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Vawula va Malawu na Mafwalisayu vakandili kuyidasha, “Ghani yadeta filongu fya kumduka Chapanga? Kwa hela mundu yawesha kupomela sambi, ila Chapanga weka hela!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu avamanyili kala chivayihola, kavadasha, mkuyihola liki mundima shenu? <verse number="23" style="v"/>Choti chivelili chipusuka nendu: kudeta, kupomeliwa sambi, awu kudeta, “Woloki yendi? <verse number="24" style="v"/>Topi, ngudayila mumanyi mwana wa mundu kana uwesu wa kupomela vandu sambi kumlima.” Kamuwombela, yula mundu yapombalili, “Tandamuki, toli ulili waku yendi kaya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Tepu, ayisili kuwoloka paulongolu ya vosi, akatolili ulili waki kayenda kayaki kunu pamujuma Chapanga. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Vosi vakayikang'anikeyi! Livakamula lyogha, pavamjuma Chapanga, pavadeta. “Tuyiwona mihilu nalelu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lawi akukemiwa ghavi mwanachuli</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 9:9-13, Maliku 2:13-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pambeli, Yesu afumili panji, amwonili mundu yasumula yivamkemaya Lawi, kayikala pa golela chichuku chaki. Yesu kamuwombela, “Ungovikeli.” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lawi afilekili fyosi, kamkovekela Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lawi amugolilili Yesu lihungu likomi kayaki na vandu vasumula mbiya na vandu vamonga vayikalili pamu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mafwalisayu na vawula va Malawu vakavang'ong'utekeleyi vandundami vaki pavadeta, Wuli mukulya na kulanda pamu na vandu yivasumula mbiya na yivavelili na sambi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Vavelili na njimba nofu vakudayila ha muyilwana, vamudayilili vala vatami.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nyisa ng'odu kuvakema vandu goleki vapomeli, ila vavelili na sambi vapomeli.</para>
  <para style="s">Milandu ya kuyikaja kulya</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 9:14-17, Maliku 2:18-22</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Vandu vamonga vamkovekela Yesu, vamuwombela, “Vandundami va Yohani mbatisha vakwikaja kulya myanja yitangalili na kudadava, hata vana chuli va Mafwalisayu vakugola wuwowu. Lakini vandundami vaku vakulya na kulanda hela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu avayangulili, “Wuli, vala vandu vavalalikili kulihungu lya kuheta mukuvadayila vayikaji kulya na kunu bambu wa lihungu lya kuheta vawa pamu? Ng'odu! <verse number="35" style="v"/>Lakini dachiyisi chipindi bambu wa lihungu lya kuheta davamuwushi pala pavayikalili pamu, chipindi achi davavi vakwikaja kulya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu avawombilili chilangushilu achi, “Vandu vakudumula ng'odu chipapi cha yingwa ya shonu na kuchivika muyingwa yisakalili, kucha pavagola naha, davavi vakudemula yila yingwa ya shonu na chila chipapi dachilinganili ng'odu na yila yingwa yisakalili. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Vala vandu vakutaya ha difwayi wa shonu mumihaku yisakalili, vawona awu difwayi ya shonu daubaluli mihaku yila, difwayi dayiyitiki na mihaku dayibaluki. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Difwayi ya shonu yikutayiwa mumihaku ya shonu. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kwahela mundu yadayila kulanda difwayi ya shonu, vakudeta wula wa dayili munofu nendu.”</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Linasha lya Lijuva lya Kupumulila</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 12:1-8, Maliku 2:23-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lijuva limu lya lijuva lya kupumulila, Yesu aveli akupita mufitava fya mpunga. Vandundami vaki vakandili kubena misasa ya mpunga, vapulula mbeyu kwa mawoku, valya. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mafwalisayu vamonga vavadashili, “Mbona mkugola chindu chingajila kujumiliwa na Malawu vetu mulijuva lya Kupumulila?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu avayangulili, “Wuli, musoma duhu wagolili Dawudi pamu na vamonga chipindi pavaveghi na njala? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mweni payingilili munyumba ya Chapanga, atolili mibumunda yivavikili ya kumtambikila Chapanga kalya na kuvapa vamonga. Na afi fyaveli mwiku kulya mundu wingi ila vatambika weka yawu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pakumalilila Yesu kavawombela, “Mwana wa Mundu ndi Bambu wa Lijuva lya Kupumulila.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mundu muna liwoku lipombalili.</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 12:9-14, Maliku 3:1-6</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lijuva lingi lya lijuva lya Kupumulila, Yesu ayingilili munyumba ya kudadavila kuvawula vandu. Mula kwaveli mundu yumu liwoku lyaki lya mlilu lyapombalili. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Vawula va Malawu na Mafwalisayu vakamuloleyi Yesu kucha dalowoli mundu Lijuva lya Kupumulila, ili vapati nongwa ya kumuhigha. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu amanyili chivayihola, kamuwombela yula yaveli na liwoku lipombalili, “Tandamuki, woloki pawulongolu.” Yula mundu ayendili, kawoloka pawulongolu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kavawombela kandi, “Nguvadasha, Malawu vetu vakujumisha kugola chindu cha nyanyi awu kugola chindu chivifyili Mulijuva lya Kupumulila? Kutanga awu kuvifya? Kulowola mundu awu kumleka adanganyiki?” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pavawolukili wosi vavelili pala, amuwombilili mundu yula, “Woloshi liwoku lyaku.” Bahala pala mweni kagola wuwula na liwoku lyaki linana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lakini veni vakalalili nesu, vawombana kumgolela milandu ya wafu Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvashawula vandundami lilongu na vavili</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 10:1-4, Maliku 3:13-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lijuva limu, ayendili kuchindunda padadava kwa Chapanga na kugunga mesu pamihi posi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Chilawu yaki avakemili vandundami vaki na vamonga kavashawula, vandu lilongu na vavili, avakemili vandundami. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Vaveli ndi Simoni, Yesu amkemeyi Petili na Andeleya mkulumundu. Yakobi na Yohani na Filipu na Batulumeyu, <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mateyi na Tomasi, Yakobi mwana wa Alufayu na Simoni mlevanila mlima wa Isilaeli. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yudasi mwana wa Yakobi na Yuda Sikaliyoti ya mshengitili Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu avawulili na kuvalowola vandu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 4:23-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Pambeli asunukili kuchidunda pamu na vandundami vaki, Yesu awolukili payityalasi. Apa pavelili na vandundami vaki na lipinga likomi lya vandu yivafumili mbembu shosi. Vafumili Yudeya na Yelusalemu na mumbwani ya Tilu na Sidoni. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Vosi vayisili kumpikanisha Yesu na kulowuliwa matami vawu. Kavalowola vosi vavelili vakutamika na vaveli na finyamkela. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Vandu vosi vadayilagha kumugufya Yesu na liwovi lyaveli likumfuma na kuvalowola vonda.</para>
  <para style="s">Ngiba na pishu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu kavaghalambukila vandundami vaki, kadeta,</para>
  <para style="q">“Vanemiliwa vala yivayimanya vakuwesha ha kwikala ngajila Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q">nongwa wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga ndi wa veni.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ngiba yumwi yumpikanila njala ponopa,</para>
  <para style="q">nongwa pambeli damwikuti.</para>
  <para style="q">Ngiba yumwi yumlila ponopa,</para>
  <para style="q">nongwa pambeli damseki kwa luseku!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Ngiba yumwi vandu pavavanyekwa na pavavasula na pavavajowoli na pavavadetela yumwi va wafu kwanongwa ya Mwana wa Mundu! <verse number="23" style="v"/>Findu afi pafifumbuka, musekileli na kudinga.</para>
  <para style="q">Nongwa nakaka fupu yenu yiva ngomi kumbindi kwa Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="q">Nahawu ndi ndambu vagogolu vawu wuvavagolilili vambuyi va Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pishu yumwi valundamali,</para>
  <para style="q">nongwa mufwamuka kala.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pishu yumwi yimwikuta ponopa,</para>
  <para style="q">nongwa pambeli damuwoni njala!</para>
  <para style="q">Pishu yumwi yumuseka kwa fisingu ponopa</para>
  <para style="q">nongwa pambeli damulili na kwidedeka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Pishu yumwi yimujumiwa na vandu vosi.</para>
  <para style="q">Nahawu ndi vagogolu vawu vavagolilili vambuyi va udesi wuwowu.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuvatama vachimdwama vetu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 5:38-48, 7:12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Nguvawombela yumwi yimumbikanisha, muvatami vachimdwama venu, muvagoleli finofu vala vaveli na maya na yumwi. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mvanemeli vala yivavalawumu yumwi na muvadadavili kwa Chapanga vala yivavagolela wafu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Mundu pakuvangula likanja limu mughalambulili na likanja lingi. Mundu pakupoka likoti lyaku mlekeli na gwanda yaku. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yoyosi yakudadava umupi na mundu pakupoka chindu chaku kotoo kumwombela akuwuyishili. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Muvagoleli vandu kucha wula wumudayila kugoliwa yumwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Kucha pamuvatama vala vavatamili yumwi weka hela, dampati chindu liki? Kwa hela! Nongwa hata vala vagola wafu vayitama veni. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Leki pamuvagolela nyanyi vala weka vavagolela finofu dapati chindu liki? Hata vala vaveli na sambi vakugola fifi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kucha mukuvakopesha vala weka mukuvashuvilila davavahombi, dampati chindu liki? Hata vala vaveli na sambi vakuvayasima vaveli na sambi vayawu ili vavawuyishili wuwula. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Ila yumwi muvatami vachimdwama venu vosi na kuvagolela finofu, mukopeshi mukotoo kushuvilila kuwuyishiwa na fupu shenu dasivi ngomi na yumwi damuvi vana va Chapanga Mkomi. Nongwa mweni ndi munofu kwa vala vangajila kulumba na yivaveli vawafu. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Muvi na lusungu kucha tati wenu pavelili na lusungu.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuvahigha vengi</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 7:1-5</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Mkotoo kuvahigha vengi na yumwi damughiwi ng'odu, mukotoo kuvalaumu vengi na yumwi davamudeti, muvapomeli vengi na yumwi damupomiliwi na Chapanga. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Muvapi vengi na yumwi damugayiliwi na damupokeli chigelu chikomi, chivadinilili njuu pwaa. Nongwa chigelu chichila chila chimuvalingilili vayenu na yumwi damugelukiwi ngimu chichila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kavawombela Chilangushilu achi, “Ngalimesu akuwesha ng'odu kumlongosha ngalimesu monga. Pakagola nahawu vosi davadubukili mulyowu. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kwahela mwanachuli yampita muwula waki, ila mwanachuli pamalila chuli daghavi kucha muwula waki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Wuli ukuchiwona chibandi chidokwa nendu chivelili mulisu lya mlongu waku na chipindi chichila ukulemwa kuliwona libalu livelili mulisu lyaku? <verse number="42" style="v"/>Awu ukuwesha wuliwuli kumuwombela mlongu waku, mlongu leki nguwushi chibandi mulisu lyaku na kunu ukuliwona ng'odu lijika liveli mulisu lyaku umweni? Yuwi mfyangu! Wushi tanila lijika liveli mulisu lyaku, pambeli dauweshi kulola unofu na dauweshi kumuwusha chibandi chiveli mulisu lya mlongu waku.</para>
  <para style="s">Libiki likumanyika kwa fivelekwa fyaki</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 7:16-20, 12:33-35</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Libiki linofu liweshi ha kulela fivelekwa fichapukili, wuwula wula libiki lya wafu likuwesha ha kulela fivelekwa finowili. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Vandu vakulimanya libiki kwa fivelekwa fyaki. Nakaka vandu vakunokola ng'odu mindopi kumitalula, awu fimungumungu mumisompondu. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Mundu mnofu akuva na milandu minofu kufuma mumbeyu nofu yifumili mumunda yaki. Mundu mwafu akugola fyawafu Kufuma mumbeyu yawafu mumunda yaki. Mundu akuywanga milandu yimemili mumunda yaki.</para>
  <para style="s">Vajengi vavili</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 7:24-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>“Nongwa liki mukungema Bambu, Bambu, kunu mukugola ha findivawombela? <verse number="47" style="v"/>Ngudayila nivapi chilangushilu wa nyanyi, yoyosi yula dayisi kwa nenga, dapikanishi filongu fyangu na kufigola, <verse number="48" style="v"/>ayu akwifwana na mundu yajenga nyumba yaki kumbindi, pasi msingi kavika kumbindi ya ligonguveli. Paliyisili lilava, lweni luyita lubosi lwa machi lupita panyumba yila, lakini yitikanyika ha, nongwa vajengili yidindalili. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Lakini yoyosi yapikanila filongu fyangu, kalema kugola chindu chochosi, ayu kayifwana na mundu yajengili nyumba mumiganga, kakotoka kukumbila msingi, Lilava paliyisa, lubosi lwa machi lupitila nyumba yila, yiwa pasi wuuuu! Na kubowoyoka!”</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumulowola ndumindumi wa mkomi wa machonda</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 8:5-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pawombanili kala na vandu, Yesu ayendili Kapelinaumu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Aku kwavelili na mkomi wa machonda mya wa Loma aveli na ndumindumi waki yamtamili munu. Ndumindumi ayu avelili mtami dabadaba.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="08 Centurion.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="7:2">Machonda wa Loma</figure> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yula mkomi wa machonda papikanishili milandu ya Yesu, kavalayisha vavaha vamova Vayawudi vayendi kumluva Yesu ayisi kumlowola ndumindumi waki. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pavafikili kwa Yesu, vamudediveka, vadeta, “Mundu ayu nakaka akudayiliwa kutangiwa na yuwi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mweni kawutama vandu va mlima wetu na mweni yatujengilili yila Nyumba ya kudadavila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Topi Yesu kayenda pamu na veni. Pavaveyi samba vafika kaya ya yula mkomi wa machonda wa Loma avatumili vaghanja mundu vamuwombeli Yesu, “Bambu, kotoo wiyasha, kwingila munyumba yangu kwanongwa nenga ngujakwa ha. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nongwa nguyiwona ngulemwa kuyisa kwa yuwi. Ila yuwi deti chilongu chimu hela, ndumindumi wangu danani. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nongwa nenga wuwowu mundu yimeli pasi ya uwesu na ndiva nawu machonda pasi yangu. Pandimuwombela yumu, ‘Yendi!’ Akuyenda, pandimuwombela wingi, ‘Wisi!’ Akwisa na ndumindumi wangu, ‘Goli chindu achi!’ Mweni akugola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu papikanishili afi kayikang'anika, kaliyendela lila lipinga lya vandu liveli likumkovikela na kudeta, “Nguvawombela ngalihela kumuwona mundu yoyosi amu Muyisilaeli yavelili na ujumilwa mkomi kucha ayu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Vala vanjagila pavafikili kaya ya mkomi wa machonda wa loma vamuwona yula ndumindumi kanana.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumshukusha mwana wa ngalimlyangu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu ayendili mlima wumu wukemiwa Naini na vandundami vaki na lipinga likomi lya vandu likumkovikela. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Paghaveyi samba kafika mlima wula, vafumbukili vandu vapapa chikongu cha mundu mlumi, aveli mwana wa paweka kwa yula mawu ngalimlyangu. Vandu vatangalili va mlima wula vaveli pamu na mawu yula. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Bambu pamuwonili mawu yula kamuwonela lusungu, kamuwombela, “Kotoo kulila!” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pambeli kayenda kuwugufya wula muwombangu na vala yivapapeyi vawoloka, kadeta, “Msongolu, ngukuwombela woloki, ngukulayila tandamuki!” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yula msongolu yaghaveyi kasova katandamuka kakanda kuywanga, Yesu kamtola yula msongolu kamupa mamundu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Vandu vosi livengila lyogha, topi vamujuma Chapanga pavadeta, mbuyi mkomi wa Chapanga katubwitukila. “Chapanga kayisa kuvalowola vandu vaki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Milandu ya Yesu yikwila kosi Yudeya na mlima wuveli pabehi.</para>
  <para style="s">Vanjagila kufuma kwa Yohani mbatisha</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 11:2-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Vandundami va Yohani vamuwombela yila milandu yosi yimwilatili Yesu, pambeli mweni Yohani mbatisha, avakemili vandundami vavili kufuma mulipinga lya vandundami vaki. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kavalayila kwa Bambu, vakamdashi, “Yuwi yula dayisi awu tumveteli wingi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Vandundami vala pavafikili kwa Yesu vamuwombela, “Yohani mbatisha katulayisha twisi kwa yuwi tukudashi, ‘Yuwi ndi yula dawisi, awu tumuveteli wingi?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Chipindi chichila chila, Yesu aveli akuvalowola vandu vatangalili vatamikeyi matami va wafu na finyamkela na kuvagola vangalimesu vatangalili valoli. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Topi Yesu kavayangula, “Muyendi mukamuwombeli Yohani mbatisha fila fimufiwonili na kufipikana, vangalimesu vakulola, ndevindevi vakuyenda yenda, yivaveli na ukalava vakung'ala, majogu vakupikanila, yivafwili vashukuka na vagayu vakulanduliwa Milandu ya Nyanyi. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ngiba mundu yula yangajila hoshu na nenga!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pambeli vandumindumi va Yohani mbatisha pavawukili, Yesu akandili kuliwombela lipinga lya vandu milandu ya Yohani mbatisha, “Pamuyendili kula kuchivala, kumlola Yohani mbatisha mukayiholeyi kuchiwona liki? Wuli mukayiholeyi kumuwona Yohani kucha liteti palitikanyika na liyegha? <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mukayendili kumlola mundu wa wuliwuli? Mukacheyi mundu yafwalili yingwa nofu? Ng'odu, vandu vakufwala yingwa sha nyanyi na kwikala ngalilu nofu vava munyumba sha wutwa! <verse number="26" style="v"/>Topi mung'ombeli mukayendili kulola liki? Wuli mwayendili kumulola mbuyi? Yina nakaka aveli mbuyi wa Chapanga, pitu mbuyi. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ayu mweni yivamdeta Yohani wa mufitabu fing'alili, ‘Loli nenga ngumlayisha makungu wangu akulonguleli, mweni dakuseveli deha yaku.’” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu amalilili kwa kudeta, “Nguvawombela, vandu vosi, kwahela yaveli mkomi kwa Yohani mbatisha. Hata naha, yula yaveli mdokwa pitu vosi, muwutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga ndi mkomi pitu Yohani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Pavapikanishili afi vandu vosi na vala vasumula mbiya vajuma ugoleki wa Chapanga, Topi vajumilili kubatishiwa na Yohani mbatisha. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lakini Mafwalisayu na vala yivamanyili unofu Malawu valemili fila fyadetili Chapanga kwa veni, topi, valemili kuvabatishiwa na Yohani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu kayendilela kudeta, “Vandu va chileli achi dandivalinganishi na chindu liki? Vava wuliwuli? <verse number="32" style="v"/>Vava kucha vasongolu vayikaleyi kusoku vakwikemesha lipinga limu na limonga, ‘Tuvakuvila ng'oma, lakini mudinga ha! Tuvasomulela msambu wa makiva lakini mlila ha!’ <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa Yohani mbatisha ayisili, kuyikaja kulya na kuleka kulanda difwayi, yumwi mudeta chimkwela chinyamkela! <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mwana wa Mundu kayisa, akulya na kulanda, yumwi mukawombeyi, ‘Mumulole ayu mbafu na njayila, vaghanja vaki vasumula mbiya na vaveli na sambi.’ <verse number="35" style="v"/>Hata naha, luhunja lwa Chapanga ulinganila luwoneka kwa vosi vamjumilili.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mukaya ya Simoni Mfwalisayu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mfwalisayu yumu amlalikili Yesu kulya filivi kaya yaki. Ayingilili munyumba ya yula Mfwalisayu, kayikala na kulya filivi. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kula kumbwani kwavelili na mawu yumu yaveli na sambi. Aveli kapikana Yesu kava kayaki yula Mfwalisayu, atolili supa yitalamili ya alabasta yimemili utuli. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kayisa, kawoloka pabehi na mawulu va Yesu, kalila misosi yaki yimusululila Yesu mumawulu. Mdala ayu kapukuta mawulu va Yesu kwa fwili shaki. Pambeli kavanonela na kumshagha mafuta va kunungilila. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yula Mfwalisayu yamlalikili Yesu pafiwonili afi, ayiholili mumunda yaki, “Kucha mundu ayu angaveli nakaka mbuyi, angamanyili mdala ayu kava wuliwuli, kucha aveli muna sambi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu kamwombela yula Mfwalisayu, “Simoni, ndiva na chindu cha kukuwombela.”</para>
  <para style="p">Simoni kayangula, “Yina muwula, deti.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu adetili, “Vandu vavili vayendili kuyasima mbiya kwa mundu yayasimisha mbiya, yumu avelili kamuyasima mbiya sha ijala ya mwesi wumu na nusu na wingi mbiya sha ijala ya mwaka wumu na nusu. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Pavalemwili kuhomba nongwa shawu, mundu yula avapomilili vosi vavili. Yoti wa ava vavili damtami munu bambu yula?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Simoni kamyangula, “Nakaka yula yapomiliwili nongwa ngomi nesu kwa yula Bambu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamuwombela, “Yina fiwuwombilili.” <verse number="44" style="v"/>Pambeli kamghalambukila yula mdala, kamuwombela Simoni, “Ukumuwona mdala ayu? Nenga panyingilili apa pakayaku, kanyimba ha machi va kuwofuwa mawulu vangu! Lakini mdala ayu kang'ofua mawulu vangu kwa misosi yaki na kumbukuta kwa fwili shaki. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Yivi kujambusha ngajila kunonela, lakini ayu mdala kukandila nyingili apa akanoneleyi mawulu vangu. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yivi kunangusha ha ligoya lyaku kwa kunshaya utuli kumutwi, lakini mdala ayu kagolela naha, kan'shagha mafuta va kunungila mumawulu vangu. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Ponopa ngukuwombela mdala ayu kapomiliwa sambi shaki sitangalili ponopa utami waki wuva mkomi. Lakini ya pomiliwa padokwa na ndamilu yaki dokwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kamuwombela yula mdala, “Ngupomela sambi shaku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Topi vala vavelili pamu palitambiku vakulya vakayidasheyi, “Ayu mundu liki akuwesha kupomela sambi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela yula mdala, “Ujumilu waku wukulowola, yendi kwa kusika.”</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Vadadala vayilongushili pamu na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kapita kumbwani na mufijijini akalanduleyi filongu fya Nyanyi fya wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga. Vala lilongu na vavili vayilongushili nawu, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wuwowu vadadala vamonga vala Yesu avelili kavawusha finyamkela na kuvalowola matami vayilongushili pamu. Ava vaveli akina Maliya yivamkema Magadalena, mweni awushiwili finyamkela vawafu saba, <verse number="3" style="v"/>na Yoana mdala wa Kusa. Kusa aveli mgolafichuku wa mkomi wa Helodi. Wuwula wula vaveli Susana na vadadala vamonga vaveli pamu na Yesu. Vadadala ava vavelili vakumukimbanikila Yesu pamu na Vandundami vaki kwa mali shawu veni.</para>
  <para style="s">Chilangushilu cha yakweta</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 13:1-9, Maliku 4:1-9</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Chipindi chimu lipinga likomi lya vandu lyavelili liyikungula pamu. Vandu kufuma mbwani shosi vakayiseyi kwa Yesu. Mweni avawombilili chilangushilu achi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Yakweta ayendili kukweta mbeyu shaki. Pakweteyi mbeyu simu, shaponikili mudeha, vandu pavapiteyi mudeha vasivatanga na vambongu valya. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Simonga shaponikili muuganga wuveli na migonguveli gonguveli, pasimelili sinyala kwanongwa kwa hela machi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Simonga shaponikili mumisomi, misomi. Mbeyu sila pasimelili sikekenekwa na misomi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Simonga shaponikili muuganga wa nyanyi, simela na kuveleka myanja miya.”</para>
  <para style="p">Pambeli Yesu kawomba, kalandusha kwa lishu, kadeta, “Yaveli na majeji apikanili!”</para>
  <para style="s">Nongwa ya kuwula kwa chilangushilu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 13:10-17, Maliku 4:10-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Vandundami vaki Yesu vamudashili mana ya chilangushilu achi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mweni kayangula, “Yumwi mugayiliwa uwesu kumanya mbwepu sha wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga, lakini ava vamonga vakupikanila kwa chilangushilu, ‘Vakuwombiwa kwa chilangushilu, ili pavalola vakotoo kuwona na pavapikanisha vakotoo kupikana.’</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuhimulila chilangushilu cha mukweta</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 13:18-23, Maliku 4:13-20</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Topi mana ya chilangushilu achi: mbeyu ndi chilongu cha Chapanga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Sila siponikili mudeha sikulangusha vandu vala vapikanishili filongu fya Chapanga, pambeli Lijangavandu kayisa kuliwusha mundima shawu vakotoo kujumila kulowuliwa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Sila siponikili muligonguveli sikulangusha vandu vala pavapikanisha fila filongu vakupokela kwa luseku. Kucha sila mbeyu, vandu ava vahela mikigha nongwa vakujumila chipindi chifupi hela na pavayeshiwa vakulemwa vakuguwa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Sila mbeyu siponikili mumibiki yiveli na misomi sikulangusha vandu yivapikanilili filongu fya Chapanga, Lakini pambeli padokwa pavawuka, vakukanda kuyipwelesha, kwa mali na kufwamuka mungalilu, veni davaleli ndili filelwa na kukomala. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Sila mbeyu siponikili muuganga wa nyanyi, ndi vandu vakupikanila filongu fya Chapanga, vakulikamulila kwa ndima usangi na ujumilwa. Ava vakwigagasha mbaka valeli fivelekwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Luliku lugubikiwili</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 4:21-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Vandu vakukwata luliku na kugubikiwa na chiyungu awu kuyivika mwifungu ya chitanda, ila vakuvika pachindangawala, vandu pavayingila mgati vawoni lwengi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Chochosi chavafisili dachiwoneki pee na mbwepu chochosi dachimanyiki na dachiwoneki pawelu pee.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Mani naha, muyiloleyi ndambu yimupikanili, nongwa avelili na chindu dayongeshwi, lakini yula yangajila chindu, hata chila chiveli cha mweni dachitoliwi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mau na valongumundu Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 12:46-50, Maliku 3:31-35</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mau na valongumundu Yesu vamukovekela, lakini valemwa kumuselelela kwanongwa kwavelili na lipinga lya vandu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mundu yumu amuwombilili Yesu, “Mawu na vafwatavaku vava panji, vakudayila kukuwona” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kavawombela vandu vosi, “Mau na valongu vangu ndi vala yivapikanisha filongu fya Chapanga na kufikamula.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akulilakalila liwumbula</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 8:23-27, Maliku 4:35-41</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lijuva limu, Yesu kayipakili muwatu pamu na vandundami vaki, kavawombela, “Tujabuki kumwambu ya lihiva.” Topi vakanda mwanja, <verse number="23" style="v"/>pavaveghi muwatu vakuyenda, Yesu simkamulili mbota, kawonja. Tepu liwumbula lyakandili mulihiva, machi vakandili kuyingila muwatu, vaveli munjifwa. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Vala vandundami vamyendela Yesu vamuyimusha, pavawomba, “Bambu, Bambu! Tukusova!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kayimuka, kafiwombela majinga na liwumbula finyamali, Tepu finyamala, filindivala jii. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela vandundami vaki “Kujumila kwa yumwi kuva koti”</para>
  <para style="p">Lakini veni vakayikang'anikeyi na kutila, kunu vakwidasha, “Ayu mundu liki? Kavawombela majinga na liwumbula linyamali vamuyitikila?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumuwusha mundu finyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 8:28-34, Maliku 5:1-20</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Vayendelela na mwanja, vakafiki mbwani ya Vagelasi pabehi na Galilaya, kumwambu ya lihiva. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pavajabukili muwatu, mundu yumu yaveli na finyamkela kamuyisila kufuma kumbwani. Majuva vatangalili mundu ayu afwalagha ha yingwa na ayikalili kaya ha ila kusembi. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Pamuwonili Yesu, kayiyasilila pasi paulongolu ya Yesu padeta kwa lishu likomi, “Yuwi Yesu mwana wa Chapanga mkomi, kuva na milandu liki na nenga? Ngukuluva ukotoo kugobola nenga!” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela yula chinyamkela amfumi mundu yula. Chinyamkela yula aveli akumuyingila mundu yula myanja yitangalili, vandu vamuwopili kwa lingongola na kumuvika munyumba, lakini myanja yitangalili adumulili mingongola, chinyamkela atuvili kuchivala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Topi Yesu kamudasha, “Litawa lyaku ghani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Mweni kayangula, “Litawa lyangu lipinga kwanongwa finyamkela vavelili vatangala.” <verse number="31" style="v"/>Fila finyamkela fikamluveyi Yesu akotoo kuvayegha panji ya kumambi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Pala pavelili na lipinga likomi lya vangubi pabehi na chidunda vakalyeyi. Topi finyamkela vala valuvili vayingili kwa vala vangubi. Mweni kavajumisha. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Finyamkela vala vafuma kwa mundu yula, vavayingila vangubi, veni vaseleka mungema yiveli ndali, vadubukila mulihiva vasova machi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Vadimangubi pavawonili milandu yosi yila, vatuva, vayenda kuvawombela vandu va kumbwani na kufitava milandu yila. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Vandu vayisili kulola milandu yifumbukili pala. Vamuyendela Yesu, vamuwona yula mundu yamfumishili finyamkela kayikala mumawulu va Yesu, kafwala yingwa na luhala lwaki lumuwuyila, vatila. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Vandu vala yivavawombileyi vandu, fila fivafiwonili kwa mundu yula kawushiwa wuliwuli. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Vandu va mlima wula wa Gelasi lyavakamulili lyova likomi. Vamuluvili Yesu awuki, ayendi. Yesu kayipakila kandi muwatu, awukili. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yula mundu yafumishilwi finyamkela akamdedekeyi vawuki pamu na mweni.</para>
  <para style="p">Lakini Yesu kamkanisha pamuwombela, <verse number="39" style="v"/>“Wuyi kaya ukavawombeli vandu vosi fyakugolilili Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">Topi mundu yula kayenda kumbwani yivayikema Lilongu, kavawombela vandu chila Yesu chamugolilili. Na vandu vosi yivapikanilili vajinga.</para>
  <para style="s">Kamwali wa Yailu na mdala yumu valowuliwa</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 9:18-26, Maliku 5:21-43</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu pawuyili kumwambu ya lihiva, lipinga lya vandu lyayisili kumyanga, wula vosi vaveli vakumuvetela. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Ayisili pala mundu yumu yivamkema Yailu, aveli mtambika wa munyumba ya kudadavila. Kamtundamila Yesu, kamluva ayendi kaya yaki, <verse number="42" style="v"/>Kwanongwa mwana waki aveli yumu hela, aveli muhinja wa myaka lilongu limu na mivili, aveli dabadaba.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu pakayendeyi, vandu vamukikili mbembi shosi. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Topi kwavelili mdala yumu mulipinga lila aveli mtami wa liholuveya kwa myaka lilongu limu na mivili, avelili kamalila kala mbiya shaki shosi kwa valungwana, kwa hela mundu aweshili kumlowola. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Mdala ayu amkovikelili Yesu kumbeli na kugufya luviniku lwa yingwa yaki. Bahala pala kanana wula utami wa liholuveya. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Yesu adashili, “Ghani kangufya nenga?”</para>
  <para style="p">Vandu vosi pavakanili, Petili kamuwombela, “Bambu, lipinga lya vandu likushengeta na kukukekeneka!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kadeta, “Kwaveli mundu kangufya nenga, nongwa nguyiwona liwovi lyangu linyangila.” <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yula mdala kalemwa kuyifisa, kafumbuka mweni kunu pakabagama kwa lyogha, kayiyasila paulongolu ya Yesu. Kakanda kuvahimulila vandu ndambu yamgufili Yesu na ndambu apatili kulowoka bahala pala. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “kamwali wangu kujumila kwaku kukulowola. Uyendi kwa kusika.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Chipindi Yesu akali pakawomba, ayisili ndundami wa mtambika mkomi wa munyumba ya kudadavila, kamuwombela, “Muhinja waku kasova kala, ukotoo kumfwasha muwula kandi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu papikanishili naha, kamuwombela Jailosi, “Ukotoo kutila, ujumili hela, mweni dalowoki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Pavafikili kaya yaki, Yesu amjumishili ng'odu mundu kuyingila pamu ila Petili, Yohani, Yakobi na valelwa va muhinja yula. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Vandu vosi vaveli vakulila na kudadava, Yesu kavawombela, “Mkotoo kulila mweni kasova ng'odu, kawonja hela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Vandu vosi vakamsekeyi, veni vamanyili aveli kasova. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu amkamulili liwoku, kadeta, “Mwana wangu, tandamuki!” <verse number="55" style="v"/>Ufuki waki wumuwuyila mhinja yula, katandamuka. Yesu kavalayila vamugayili filivi. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Valeli vaki vayikanganika nesu, lakini Yesu kavawombela vakotoo kumuwombela mundu milandu yigolikili.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalayila vala lilongu na vavili</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 10:5-15, Maliku 6:7-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu avakemili vala lilongu na vavili, avagayilili liwovi na uwesu wa kuvavinga finyamkela na kulowola matami. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pambeli kavalayila vayendi vakalanduli chilongu cha wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga na kuvalowola vatami. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kavawombela, “Pamuva na mwanja mukotoo kutola chindu chochosi: Mkotoo kutola Lukweku na muhaku na filivi na mbiya na lihabiti lingi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nyumba yoyosi damuyingili na kuvalibushila, muyikali mbaka pamuwuka mlima wula. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Vandu pavalema kuvalibushila, muwuki mlima wula, pamuwuka mupundi lifu mumawulu venu yivi utovileli kwa veni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Topi vandundami vakandili mwanja, vapita kunu pavalandula milandu ya Chapanga na kulowola vatami kila luvagha.</para>
  <para style="s">Kushushutika kwa Helodi</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 14:1-12, Maliku 6:14-29</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ponopa, Helodi aveli akutavala, apikanili milandu yosi yiveli yikugoleka, ashushutikili kwanongwa vamonga vakawombeyi, Yohani Mbatisha yasovili kashukuka. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Vamonga vakawombeyi kucha Eliya kawuya na vamonga vakawombeyi naha, mundu yumu yaveli mtambika wa dayili wa Chapanga kawuya mumlima. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lakini Helodi kayendelela kudeta, “Yohani mbatisha ndimudumula mutwi, ponopa ayu yimbikana milandu yaki ghani?” Aveli na dobukelu ya kumuwona Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvagayila filivi vandu alufu muhanu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 14:13-21, Maliku 6:30-44</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Vala vandundami pavawuyili, vamuwombela Yesu fyosi fyavagolili. Yesu avatolili, kayenda pamu nawu pangajila vandu kumbwani ya Betisayida. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lakini vala vandu pavamanyili kwayendili vamkovikelili. Yesu kavalibushila na kuvahimulila milandu ya wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga, kavalowola vala vadayileyi kulowuliwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lijuva palihongili, vala lilongu na vavili vamuyendela na kumuwombela, “Wuvayitawuli vandu vayendi kaya shawu vakasaki filivi na pakuwonja. Apa patuvelili padasi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kavawombela, “Yumwi damuvapi filivi.”</para>
  <para style="p">Vamyangula, “Tuvahela chindu, tuva na mibumunda muhanu na vasomba vavili hela. Yuwi ukudayila tuyendi tukavahemileli filivi lipinga lyosi ali?” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pala paveli na vandu vatangalili, valulumi weka vaveli milongu mya muhanu.</para>
  <para style="p">Topi Yesu kavalayila vandundami vaki, “Muvawombeli vandu vayikali fipinga fya vandu milongu muhanu milongu muhanu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Vandundami vaki vagola kucha wavalayilili, vosi vayikala pasi. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu katola yila mibumunda muhanu na vala vasomba vavili, kalola kumbindi, kamlumba Chapanga, kametula, kavapa vandundami vaki, vavapi vandu valyi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Vandu vosi valya, vayikuta. Pavasosolili filivi fisighalili, vamemesha fitandavala lilongu na fivili.</para>
  <para style="s">Petili akujumila Yesu ndi Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 16:13-19, Maliku 8:27-29</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lijuva limu, Yesu aveli akudadava weka yaki, vandundami vaki vaveli pamu na mweni. Topi kavadasha, “Vandu vakudeta nenga ghani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Veni vamuyangula, “Vamonga vakudeta yuwi kuva Yohani mbatisha, vamonga vakudeta yuwi Eliya na vamonga mbuyi wa Chapanga wa dahili kushukuka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kavadasha, “Yumwi mukucha nenga ghani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Petili kayangula, “Yuwi kuva Kilistu Mkombola, yuwushawuliwili na Chapanga.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kavakana vakotoo kumuwombela mundu yoyosi milandu ayi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvawombela milandu ya kusova kwa mweni</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 16:20-28, Maliku 8:30-9:1</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu kayendelela kudeta kucha mwana va mundu aweshi kugoboleka nendu dalemiwi na vavaha na vatambika vakomi na vawula va Malawu na kuwulayiwa, lakini pavapita majuva matatu dashukuki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Pambeli kavawombela vandu vosi, “Mundu yoyosi padayila kungovekela nenga, ayilemi mweni kwa kulema findu fila fiudayila. Atoli lupingika lwaki majuva vosi, angovikeli. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nongwa, mundu yadayila kuwugombola unofu waki mweni, dawuyaghamishi, lakini mundu yoyosi dayaghamishi unofu waki na kungovikela nenga dawulowoli. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Wuli kuna fwayida liki mundu dapati mali shosi sha mlima kwa kuyiyamisha awu kuyimalila mweni? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mundu pang'onela soni nenga na ng'ulilu yangu, mwana wa mundu damuwoneli soni mundu ayu chipindi payisa muukomi waki na wa Tati na vamakungu vang'alili. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nguvawombela nakaka, kuna vandu vamonga bahapa davasovi ha ngajila kuwuwona wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akughalambuka</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 17:1-8, Maliku 9:2-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Palipitili lijuma limu kufumila pawombili afi, Yesu kavatola Petili na Yohani na Yakobi, kayenda nawu kuchidunda kudadava. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Paghaveyi akudadava, bahala pala kuwushu yaki kwaghalambukili, yingwa shaki siva mbuleteee!. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Tepu, vandu vavili vawonekili pavaywanga pamu, veni vaveli Musa na Eliya, <verse number="31" style="v"/>vaveli vafumbuka na ukomi, vakaywangeyi pamu milandu ya kumalishila chichuku cha Chapanga waki kwa kusova kula Yelusalemu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Petili na vamonga vaveli vakamuliwa na mbota, hata pavayimukili, vauwonili ung'alili wa Yesu, ukomi kwa vala vandu vavili vavelili pamu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Bahala pala vandu vala pavamlekili Yesu, Petili amuwombilili Yesu, “Bambu, tujengi mibudi mitatu, limu lyaku, limu lya Musa na limonga lya Eliya.” Nakaka akamanyeyi ng'odu kucha akuwomba liki. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Petili aveli akudeta afi, lyawonikili lifundi, chimbwepa chaki chavagubikili, lifundi lila palivagubikili vala vandundami vatila nendu. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Vapikana lishu kufuma mula mulifundi, “Ayu mwana wangu yinimushawulili, mumpikanishi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Pambeli lishu lila palinyamalili vamuwona Yesu kaweka hela. Vanachuli vayikalili jii kwa afi fyosi, vamuwombela mundu ha milandu yosi vayiwonili.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumuwusha Chinyamkela mwana yuutunga.</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 17:14-18, Maliku 9:14-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Chilawu yaki pavasunukeyi kufuma kuchidunda, lipinga likomi lya vandu lyatang'anikili na Yesu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mundu yumoyu mulipinga lila kalandula kwa lishu, kadeta, “Muwula! Ngukuluva umuloli mwana wangu yumu hela! <verse number="39" style="v"/>Chinyamkela akumkamula tepu akuwuta kwa lishu, kandi akumtaya chisilika, kunu likumfuma lifulufulu mumlomu. Limuyashili nendu pambeli lyamulekili ayendi. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ndivaluva Vandundami vaku vamuvingi lakini valemwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu kayangula, “Yumwi chileli chingajila ujumilwa na chiveli na sambi! Dandiyikali na yuwi mbaka ndili? Dandiyiwunishili mbaka ndili?” Pambeli kamuwombela, “Muyeghi mwana waku apa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Chipindi mwana ayu payiseyi kwa Yesu, yula chinyamkela kamuwisha pasi na kamtaya chisilika. Lakini Yesu kamlakalila chinyamkela, kamulowola mwana na kumugayila tati mundu. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Vandu vosi vayikanganikili liwovi lya paweka lya Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvahimulila kandi milandu ya kusova.</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 17:22-23, Maliku 9:30-32</para>
  <para style="p">Vala vandu pavaveghi vakali hela vakwikanganika milandi yosi yagolili, Yesu kavawombela vandundami vaki, <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Mteghi majeji, mpikanishi milandu ayi. Kucha Mwana wa Mundu datayiwi mumawoku va vandu.” <verse number="45" style="v"/>Lakini veni vamanya ng'odu filongu fila, fiyifisa kwa veni vakotoo kumanya na vakatileyi kumudasha filongu afi.</para>
  <para style="s">Ghani yaveli mkomi?</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 18:1-15, Maliku 9:33-37</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Vandundami vaki vakalimbaneyi, “Ghani mkomi gati ya veni?” <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yesu avamanyili luhala lwau chavayiholeyi mundima shawu, topi kamtola mwana mdokwa kamvika pabehi yaki. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Avawombilili, “Mundu yoyosi yamupokela mwana mdokwa kucha ayu kwa litawa lyangu, akumbokela nenga na yambokela nenga akumpokela na yula anayishili. Wula yula aveli mdokwa pagati ya yumwi vosi, ayu ndi mkomi kupita mwavosi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yalimbana ng'odu na yumwi kava mwambu wenu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 9:38-40</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yohani kayanga pawomba, “Bambu, tumuwona mundu yumu akuwusha finyamkela kwa litawa lyaku, yufwi tumkanisha nongwa mweni wa lipinga lyetu ha!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kamuwombela, “Mkotoo kumkanisha, yangajila kulimbana na yumwi kava mwambu wenu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Vasamaliya vakulema kumuyanga Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Chipindi pachifikili Yesu kutoliwa kumbindi kwa Chapanga, mweni awonili ayendi Yelusalemu. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Topi kavalayila vanjagila vamlonguleli, vayendi Samaliya kumtanda vafiwona findu fyosi fyadeteyi mweni. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Lakini venikaya va pala valema kumuyanga kwanongwa aveli akuyenda Yelusalemu. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Topi vandundami vaki, akina Yohani na Yakobi, pavawonili naha, vadeta, “Bambu, ukudayila tuvalayishili motu usumuki kufuma kumbindi uvalungushi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kavaghalambukila kavalakalila. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu na vandundami vaki vayendili kaya singi.</para>
  <para style="s">Vakujumiliwa vavi ndundami</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 8:19-22</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Pavaveghi munjila kuyenda Yelusalemu, mundu yumu kamuwombela Yesu, “Dandikukovikeli kosi kuwuyenda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Fingekembi vana mbaku na vambongu vana fiyumba lakini nenga mwana va mundu ndivahela pakwikala na pakupumulila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Kamuwombela mundu wingi kandi, “Ungovikeli.”</para>
  <para style="p">Lakini mundu yula adetili, “Bambu, uneki tanila nyendi ngamsiki Tati wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Yesu kamuyangula, valeki vasovili vamsiki asovili muyawu, yuwi uyendi ukalanduli wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Mundu wingi kandi kamuwombela, “Bambu ngudayila kukukovikela lakini uneki tanila ngavayitawuli vandu yivaveli kayangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Yoyosi yakamula lihuka palima kunu palola kumbeli, ayu akujakwa ha kuwutwa wa Chapanga.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalayisha vanachuli milongu saba na vavili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pambeli Bambu avashawulili vanachuli vamonga milongu saba na vavili, kavalayisha vavili vavili, valonguleli mbwani yosi na mahali kosi padayilili kuyenda. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kavawombela, “Filivi fitangala, lakini vakubena vadokwa. Ponopa mumuluvi muna chitava avalayishi vagola chichuku cha kuchitava cha Bambu vakabeni. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Muyendi, nguvalayisha yumwi kucha vafungami pagati ya fingekembi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mkotoo kutola muhaku wa mbiya na likanda na mikobasi, mudeha mukotoo kumjambusha mundu yoyosi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pamuyingila munyumba yoyosi, yakwaa muvajambushi naha, ‘Kusika kuvi munyumba ayi!’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Leki mundu padayila kusika avalibushili, kusika kwa yumwi dakuvi na mweni, leki kwahela mundu yadayila kusika, kusika dakuvawuyili. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Muyikali munyumba ayi pamulya na kulanda fyavavapili, nongwa mgola chichuku akudayiliwa ijala yaki. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pamuyingila mlima wowosi na vandu pavavapokela, mulyi filivi fyavavapa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Muvalowoli vatami vavelili aku, muvawombeli vandu, wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga wuva pabehi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Leki pamuyingila mumbwani yoyosi, pavavalibushila ng'odu, mufumi, pamupita mudeha shawu mudeti naha, <verse number="11" style="v"/>hata lifu lya mumbwani yenu palilemilela mumawulu yenu muyipundi ayi yivi kucha ngayikilu kwa veni. ‘Muvi na ngumbungumbu kucha wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga wuva pabehi kwisa.’ <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nguvawombela nakaka, lijuva lya highilu palifika Chapanga dalangushi usangi mumbwani ya Sodoma pitu mumbwani ayi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ngiba mbwani singajila kupomela</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 11:20-24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Pishu yuwi mbwani ya Kolasini! Pishu na yuwi mulima wa Betisayida! Mihilu yigolikili kwa yumwi yingagolikili kula kumulima wa Tilu na mulima wa Sidoni, vandu vaki, vangafwalili mikungi na kwibunga lifu, kuyilangusha kucha vapomela! <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lakini lijuva lya highilu palifika Chapanga dalangushi usangi mumlima wa Tilu na mumlima wa Sidoni pitu yumwi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Na yuwi mlima wa Kapelinaumu! Wuli mkacheyi wuyikweshi mbaka kumbindi kwa Chapanga? Dawusunushwi mbaka kumambi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kandi kavawombela, “Yavapikanisha yumwi, akumbikanisha nenga na yalema kuvapokela, akulema kunyanga nenga. Na yoyosi yalema kunyanga, akumlema kumyanga yula yanayishili.”</para>
  <para style="s">Vala milongu saba na vavili vakuwuya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Pambeli vala milongu saba na vavili vawuya kunu pavanemilela, vadeta, “Bambu,” “hata finyamkela patuvawombilili chindu kwa litawa lyaku vatujumila!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Ndimuwona Lijangavandu paponeka kucha lupanda kufuma kumbindi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yina ndivagayila uwesu wa kuvata njoka na vanyunji na kumalila liwovi lyosi lya Lijangavandu, wala kwahela chindu dachivagoboli. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lakini, mukotoo kusekilela finyamkela kuvajumila, ila musekileli matava venu vayandikiwa kumbindi kwa Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Seku ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 11:25-27,13:16-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Chipindi chichila chila, Yesu kasekelela kwa uwesu wa Mfuki Mng'alili, kadeta, “Chikomu bambu Tati, Bambu wa kumbindi na kumlima, nongwa kuvagubutulila findu vangajila kusoma na kuvafifa findu afi vaveli na luhunja na vaveli na luhala lwa kusoma. Yina Tati, yikunovela nahawu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kavawombela, “Tati wangu kanyimba findu fyosi. Kwahela yamumanyili mwana ila Tati, wala amumanyili Tati ila mwana na yoyosi yula mwana damudayili kumlangusha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Pambeli kavawuyila vala yivamkovikileyi kavawombela, “Munemiliwa vosi yimufiwona afi! <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nguvawombela kucha, ndundami wa Chapanga na vatwa vadayilili kufiwona fila fimufiwona yumwi valemwa kufiwona na kupikanisha vakupikanisha ng'odu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Chilangushilu cha Msamaliya msangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pambeli mundu yavamanyili Malawu va musa kawoloka, kamdasha akadayileyi kumtegha, “muwula goli liki ili niyikali jola?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kamudasha, “Vayandika liki Mumalawu? Kuchimanya?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kamuyangula, “ ‘Umtami Bambu Chapanga waku kwa moyu waku wonda, kwa ndima yaku yosi, kwa liwovi lyaku lyosi na kwa luhala lwaku losi. Na, umtami mwawu ngimu wuyitama umweni.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Kuyangula nyanyi! Goli nahawu na dawuvi mnofu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lakini mweni akadayileyi kuyilangusha kucha mundu goleki, kamdasha Yesu, “Mjofi wangu ghani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu kamyangula, “Mundu yumoyu avelili akusunuka kufuma Yelusalemu akuyenda Yeliku. Pakaveyi mudeha, vamkamulili vapoki, vampokili findu na kumtova, vamleka kawonja pala dabadaba. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Njuka mtambika yumu apitili deha yila. Pamuwonili, achamili mumbali. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Wuwula na Mlawi yumu, pafikili pala, kamuwona, kapita pambali. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Lakini Msamaliya yumoyu aveli mumwanja, pafikili pala paveli yula mundu, mweni pamuwonili kamuwonela lusungu. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kamuselelela, kamtaya mufilonda fyaki mafuta na difwayi, kamuwopa na kampaka mu chihongu waki, kamuyegha kunyumba ya vahenja kumulwasha. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Chilawu yaki katola mbiya sha ijala ya majuva mavili, kamgayila yula mkola kaya, kamuwombela, ‘Mlwasi mundu ayu na chochosi daumgayili kandi, dahombi pang'uya.’”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu kadasha kandi, “Gati ya ava vatatu, ndi yoti yalangushili mjofi waki yula mundu yaduliyiliwi na vapoki?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Mundu yamanyili unofu Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa, ayangulili, “Yula amuwonilili lusungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamuwombela, “Yendi ukagoli wuwowu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kaya ya Malita na Maliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Pavaveyi mumwanja, vayingila kuchijiji chimu na mdala yumu yivamkemeyi Malita, kamlalika kaya yaki. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Malita avelili na mkulu mundu vakamkemeyi Maliya, ayu ayikalili pabehi na Bambu akapikanisheyi mawuli vaki. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Lakini Malita aveli akukimbanikila milandu yingi. Kamyendela Yesu, kumuwombela, “Bambu, ukuwona nahau kavifya ng'odu, mlongu wangu kuneka ngukimbanika weka yangu? Topi umuwombeli, andangi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Lakini Bambu kamyangula, “Malita, Malita, ukukimbanika na kuyiyasha na milandu yitangalili. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Chindu chimu hela chitalama. Maliya kashawula chindu cha nyanyi nesu, cheni kwa hela mundu dampoki.”</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuwula kudadava</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 6:9-13, 7:7-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lijuva limu, Yesu aveli mahali pamopa akudadava. Pakamalishili kudadava, mwanachuli yumu kamuwombela, “Bambu, utuwuli kudadava kucha Yohani mbatisha wavawulili vandundami vaki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu kayangula, “Pamudadava, mulongi:</para>
  <para style="q">‘Tati:</para>
  <para style="q">Litawa lyaku ling'alili lijumiwi,</para>
  <para style="q">wutwa waku wisi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Tukuluva utugayili filivi fyetu lijuva kwa lijuva.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Tukuluva utupomeli sambi shetu,</para>
  <para style="q">kucha wula yufwi wutuvapomela vosi vatuvifyili,</para>
  <para style="q">ukotoo kututaya mumayeshu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela vanachuli vaki, “Leki muyenu yumu kayenda kwa ghanja waki pamihi nendu, kamuwombela, ‘Ghanja, dekudeku unyasimi mibumunda mitatu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ghanja wangu kapitila kayangu kava mumwanja na nenga nahela chindu cha kumgayila.’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Na mweni angavili kamugati angamuyangulili, ‘Kotoo kunyasha! Ndata kala litatilu. Nenga na vana vangu tuwonja, nguwesha ng'odu kuyimuka ngugayili!’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ngukuwombela, hata naha dayimuki ng'odu amgayili mibumunda kwanongwa mweni ghanja waki, lakini dayimuki na kumugayila chila chadayila kwanongwa akuyendelela kumuluva.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nguvawombela, “Pamuluva dampati, pamsaka damuwoni, pamukuta mulyangu damufuwuliwi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yoyosi yaluva dapati, yasaka dawoni na yakuta mulyangu dafuwuliwi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mwana pamuluva tatimundu somba, wuli damgayili njoka badili ya somba? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Na pamuluva liyi, wuli damgayili nyunji? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nga yumwi, hata leki muvavifyi mumanya kuvagayila vana venu findu finofu, nakaka tati wenu wa kumbindi dagoli nesu, davagayili Mfuki Mng'alili kwa vala yivamluva.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na mkomi wa finyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 12:22-30, Maliku 3:20-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lijuva limu Yesu aveli akumvinga chinyamkela amgolili mundu yumu kava ngadeta. Topi ayu chinyamkela kamfuma, yula ngadeta kawesha kudeta, hata lipinga lya vandu vayikanganika. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lakini vandu vamu vadeta, “Akuvavinga finyamkela kwa liwovi lya Besibuli, mkomi wa finyamkela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Vamonga vamyeshili vadayilili avalangushili mihilu valoli mweni kajumiliwa na Chapanga. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu amanyili veni chivayihola, kavawombela, “Wutwa wowosi wuvelili witapula daulemwi kuwoloka. Kaya yoyosi yiveli yiyitapula dayilemwi kuwoloka. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Leki wutwa wa Lijangavandu, mani wukwitapula, wutwa waki dauwesi wuliwuli kuwoloka? Mukudeta liki, nguvavinga finyamkela kwa liwovi lya mkomi wa finyamkela Besibuli? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mani nguvingavinga finyamkela kwa liwovi lya mkomi wa finyamkela Besibuli, vana venu vakuvinga kwa liwovi lya ghani? Kwa liwovi lya Besibuli? Ng'odu. Vana venu yumwi davavahighi wafu wa yumwi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lakini panavavinga finyamkela kwa liwovi lya Chapanga, topi umanyi wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga ufika kala kayenu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Mundu aveli na liwovi padima nyumba yaki kwa lisomelu, findu fyaki fyosi fisiyala ngali kuhijiwa. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lakini, payisa yaveli na liwovi likomi, pamdula na kumtova, ayu dampoki misomelu yaki yosi ayidumbileyi na kubajanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Yoyosi yalema kuva na nenga, akujumila ng'odu nenga na yoyosi yalema kusosola pamu na nenga, akumwaghanga.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuwuya kwa chinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 12:43-45</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Chinyamkela pafuma kwa mundu, akushengeta kuchivala kusaka pa kupumulila. Pakapota akuyiwombela mweni ‘Dang'uyi kayangu kufumili’. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pawuya, akwiwona yila nyumba vafyayila na valemba. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Topi akuyenda kuvatola finyamkela vamonga saba pitu mweni, vosi vakuyenda kumwingila mundu yula. Ngalilu ya mundu ayu ponopa yikuvipa munu pitu dahili.”</para>
  <para style="s">Luseku lwa nakaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Paghaveyi akudeta afi, mdala yumu mulipinga lila lya vandu, kadeta kwa kulandusha, “Ngiba mdala yakulelili na kukuyongesha!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu kayangula, “Lakini ngiba nendu vala vakupikanisha filongu fya Chapanga na kufikamula.”</para>
  <para style="s">Vandu vakudayila mihilu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 12:38-42</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lipinga lya vandu paliyongishekili, Yesu kavawombela, “Chileli achi ndi chileli cha wafu, chikudayila chilangushilu, lakini dachipati ng'odu chochosi cha kulangusha ila wula muhilu wa Yona. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kucha Yona aveli chilangushilu kwa vandu va Ninawi na mwana va mundu daghavi chilangushilu kwa chileli achi. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Mhumbu wa kundambalilu dawoneki chipindi ulelwa awu ukuhighiwa na mweni dachihighi kucha chivifya. Nongwa mweni atyangili kufumila kutali, kayisa kupikanisha filongu fya luhunja fya Solumoni na kumbi apa pana mkomi pitu Solumoni. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Vandu va Ninawi davawoneki chipindi cha kuhigha, veni davahighi ulelwa awu kucha uvifya. Nongwa va Ninawi vapomela, kwanongwa Yona avalandulili filongu fya Chapanga na kumbi apa pana mkomi pitu Yona!</para>
  <para style="s">Ngesha ya mvili</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 5:15, 6:22-23</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Kwa hela mundu yakwata luliku na kugubika na chiyungu, ila tukuvika kumbindi ya chindangawala ili vandu vayingili mugati vapati ngesha ya kulolela. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lisu lyaku ndi limbamba lya mvili waku, paliva linofu, mvili waku wonda dawuvi na ngesha. Lisu lyaku paliva litojoka na mvili waku weni dawuvi mulwisa. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Topi uloleyi, ngesha yivelili mugati yaku yikotoo kuva lwisa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mani mvili waku wonda wuna ngesha, mvili awu daung'ali nesu kucha wula limbamba lya motu likung'alika.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvang'ong'otekela Mafwalisayu na vawula va Malawu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 23:1-36, Maliku 12:38-40</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu pakaywangeyi, Mfwalisayu yumu kamlalika kaya yaki mufilivi. Mweni kayenda, kuyikala kulya filivi. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ayu Mfwalisayu ayikanganikili kumuwona Yesu akulya filivi ngajila kunava. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Bambu kadeta, “Yumwi Mafwalisayu Mukung'ofuwa fikombi na sahani panji hela, lakini mugati yenu mumema lukilu na wafu. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Vapufi yumwi! Yagolili fya panji, yuyula ng'odu yagolili na fya mugati? <verse number="41" style="v"/>Muvagayili vagaju fila findu fivelili mugati na fyosi dafiwi fya nyanyi kwa yumwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Lakini pishu yumwi Mafwalisayu! Kwa nongwa mkusumula vandu zaka hata kwa midasi ya kutelekela filivi, linjambu na makolu vosi na kunu mukulola ng'odu haki na kumdayila Chapanga. Milandu ayi dayiwi mukukamulila mukotoo kuyivasuva na fila fimonga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Pishu kwa yumwi Mafwalisayu! Mkudayila kuyikala kuulongolu mahali pa vakomi munyumba ya kudadavila na kujambushiwa kwa ndundamilu musoku. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Pishu kwa yumwi Mafwalisayu, kwanongwa muva kucha lyowu liveli lipala lingajila kuwoneka, vandu vakudubukila ngajila kumanya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Mundu yumu yamanyili nesu Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa kamuwombela, “muwula, kwa filongu fyaku fiwudetili kutujohola yufwi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesu kayangula, “Pishu na yumwi vawula va Malawu! Mukuvapapisha vandu misiwu yingajila kupapika, kunu mwaveni mkulemwa kukamula hata kwa chala chimu kuvatanga. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Pishu hata kwa yumwi, yimujenga sembi nofu sha vambuyi va Chapanga, vavala vala vawulayiwili na vavaha venu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yumwi mwaveni mukutovilela na kuwona fila fivagolili vavaha venu finofu, nongwa veni vavawulayili ava vambuyi va Chapanga na yumwi mukujengela sembi shawu. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Luhunja lwa Chapanga lukudeta nahau, ‘Dandivayegheli vambuyi na ndundami, lakini davavawulayi vamonga na kuvagobola vamonga.’ <verse number="50" style="v"/>Ponopa damuchiwoni dachivafumbukili, chileli achi dachitoviwi na kuhomba mwasi wuyitikili wa vambuyi vosi kukandila mlima pawulumbiwili, <verse number="51" style="v"/>kufumila mwasi wa Abeli wuyitikili mbaka mwasi wa Sakaliya vamuwulayili pagati ya fyalu kunyumba ya Chapanga. Yina nguvawombela ulelwa awu chamotu davachiwoni kwa fila fivagolili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>“Pishu yenu, yumwi vandu va Malawu! Mufisa funguwu sha mlyangu wa luhala, mwaveni muyingila ng'odu, kunu muvakika vala yivayesha kuyingila, vakotoo kuyingila!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Yesu pakafumeyi pala, vala Mafwalisayu na vawula va Malawu vakandili kuyishosha na kuyilakalila na kumdasha minasha yitangalili. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Vakamteghili vapati pa kumuwomesha kwa filongu fyaki.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mloleyi milandu ya ufyangu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 23:1-36, Maliku 12:38-40</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu akung'ong'oleka kwa Mafwalisayu na vawula va Malawu, chipindi vandu vamanyikili pavaveghi vayikungula hata vakayivatangeyi, Yesu avawombilili kukandila vandundami vaki, muyiloleyi na mawuli va Mafwalisayu, nongwa va uyengeleji. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Chila chigubikiliwi dachigubutuliwi, chila chiyifisili dachiwoneki pawelu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nahau chila mdetili mulwisa, vandu davapikinishi kulwengi na chila chimpwepweyi pa chifisu milyangu yitatiwa, dafilanduli kulipaghali lya nyumba.</para>
  <para style="s">Ghani Tumtili</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 10:28-31</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Nguvawombela yumwi vaghanja vangu, mukotoo kuvatila vala yivawulagha mvili, vakotoo kugola chindu chingi kandi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Dandivalangushi yula wa kumtila, mumtili Chapanga, yula pakuwulagha kana liwovi lya kukuyasila mumotu wa lifumbika. Yina nguvawombela, mumtili ayu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Yikumanyika kucha sheveli muhanu vakuhemesha kwa migwala mivili? Lakini kwa Chapanga akwivasuwa ha hata sheveli yumu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hata fwili sha mumitwi yetu sivalangiwa shosi. Mukotoo kutila, yumwi mtalama kupita sheveli vatangalili!</para>
  <para style="s">Kumjumila na kumlema Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 10:32-33, 12:32, 10:19-20</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Nguvawombela nakaka, mundu yajumila pavandu ayu wa nenga, mwana wa mundu mweni damujumili kwa makungu wa Chapanga kucha mundu ayu waki. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lakini, mundu yanema nenga pavandu, mwana wa mundu na mweni damulemi kwa makungu va Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Yula yadeta filongu fya kumlema Mwana wa Mundu, dapomiliwi, lakini yamjowola Mfuki Mng'alili dapomeliwi ha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Pavayegha yumwi munyumba ya kudadavila na kwa vanauwesu na vatavala, mukotoo kuva na lyova wuliwuli damuyiseyi awu ndambu liki damdeti. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nongwa chipindi achi Mfuki Mng'alili davawuli chila cha kudeta.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kucha mlundamali mpufi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mundu yumoyu mulipinga lila lya vandu kavawombela, “muwula, muwombeli mlongu wangu tuvaghani findu fya mbala fyatulekilili tati.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu kamuyangula, “Ghanja, ghani Kamika nenga nduvi vakuvalamulila awu mnjalamila wenu?” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Topi kavawombela vosi, “Muyiloleyi na ndambu shosi sha luhujulu, nongwa unofu wa mundu akwidumbila findu fitangalili avelili nafyu ha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Pambeli kavawombela chilangushilu achi, “Kwavelili mlundamali yumu ayu chitava chaki amotili. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mlundamali ayu kayihola kumoyu vaki, ‘Dagoli wuliwuli nimweni nahela pakuvika fibeniwili? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Dagoli naha, dabomoli sanja shangu na dajengi ngomi nesu. Nimweni damiki amu fibeniwili fyosi na mali shangu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ponopa nguwesa kuuwombela moyu wangu, ponopa ndiva nawu lusanja lwa kuvanja kwa myaka yitangalili. Dauyinomi kulya, kulanda na daukenuki.’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lakini Chapanga amuwombilili, ‘Kwa mpufi yuwi, lelu pamii moyu waku dautoliwi. Na findu fila fyosi fiwulundikili dafiwi fya ghani?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu amalilili pakawombeyi, “Yina dayivi kwa mundu yayilundikila mali nweni, lakini mweni kwa Chapanga, mlundamali ha.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mwidumbi Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 6:25-34</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kandi Yesu avawombilili vandundami vaki. Nongwa ayi nguvawombela, mukotoo kuyipwelesha ngalilu yenu kucha damulyi liki na mukotoo kuyipwelesha mivili yenu kucha dayifwali liki. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ngiba unofu pitu filivi na mvili utalama pitu yingwa. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mloli kukandila dahili vangungulu, vakukweta ng'odu, vakubena ng'odu na vahela lusanja. Na Chapanga akuvagola vayikuti. Yumwi mtalama munu pitu vambongu! <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yumwi ghani kwanongwa ya kukimbanika kwaki, akuwesha kuyiyongishela padokwa saa shaki kuyikala kumlima? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Topi mukulemwa kugola findu fidokwa kucha achi, kwa liki wuvi ukuyipwelesha milandu yingi? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mloli toni mawua pavamelili. Yakugola ha chichuku wala kugola yingwa shawu. Lakini nguvawombela, hata Solumoni mweni na ukomi waki wosi avalilili nyanyi ha kupita lina limu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Topi payiva Chapanga nalelu akulifwalisha nahau lidasi lya kufitawa payiva chilawu likuyasiwa mumotu, wuli davavagoleli wuwu yumwi? Yumwi mwavandu mvelili na ujumilwa mdokwa!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Topi mukotoo kupuva luhala, mkusaka kulya na liki damunyuwi. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nongwa afi fyosi vakukimbanikila vala vandu vosi vangalimesu kumumanya Chapanga. Tati wenu wa kumbindi kamanya mukudayila findu afi. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Mkukimbanikila kukandila wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga na fimonga davagayili kwa kuvayongishela.</para>
  <para style="s">Kwivikila lusanja kumbindi kwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 6:19-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Mkotoo kutila, yumwi vandumindumi vangu! Nongwa Tati wenu wa kumbindi akudayila kuvapa wutwa. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mchulusi mali shenu mukavagayili vagaju mbiya asi. Muyigoleli mihaku yingali kusakala na kwivikila lusanja kumbindi kwa Chapanga kula dayiyangili ng'odu. Kula vefi davaseleli ng'odu na davalyi umehi ha. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Pala pawuvelili ulundamali mali waku, ndi moyu waku dawuvi bahala.</para>
  <para style="s">Vagolafichuku vanaliyoya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>“Muvi kala kuhidika lufunga muchiwunu na taa shenu sivi sikuyaka. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Muvi kucha vagolafichuku vakulembelela bambu vawu awuyi kufuma kulihungu lya kuheta, ili vamfuulili mlyangu pakabisha. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Ngiba vala vagolachichuku veni bambu vawu pakawuya davawoni vayikala mesu! Yina nguvawombela ayu bambu dayiwopi lufunga muchiwunu. Davakalishi pamesa kuvakimbanikila. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Leki pawuya pamii pamandandu awu njowolu pavika na kuvawona vayikala mesu, ngiba ava vagolafichuku! <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mumanyi, leki muna nyumba angamanyili kucha mwifi dayisi chipindi liki, angagungili mesu, wala angayilekili ng'odu nyumba yaki vayibomoli. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yumwi damuyikali kala, nongwa mwana va mundu dayisi saa yingajila kuyimanya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mgolafichuku mnofu na mgolafichuku mfyangu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 24:45-51</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Petili kamuwombela, “Bambu, chilangushilu achi ndi kwa yufwi hela awu kwa vandu vosi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Bambu ayangulili, “Ghani yaveli mgolafichuku munofu na yaveli na luhala, daghavi Bambu vaki damviki mkomi wa vagolafichuku vaki ili avapi filivi chipindi cha nyanyi? <verse number="43" style="v"/>Ngiba ndumindumi ayu, payiva Bambu vaki pakawuya damuwoni kagola nahau. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Nakaka, nguvawombela dandimupi ukomi na mali shaki shonda. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Lakini mani ndumindumi ayu payiwombela mundima, ‘Bambu vangu kahava munu kuwuya.’ Kandi akandili kuvatovanga vagolafichuku vayaki, valulumi awu vadadala na kulya, kulanda na kulovela, <verse number="46" style="v"/>Bambu vaki dawuyi lijuva lingajila kumanyika na saa angali kuyimanya, damdamuli mgolafichuku ayu muwafu na kumvika mulipinga limu na vangajila kumjumila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>“Ndumindumi yaveli kamanya fyadayila bambu mundu. Lakini akwivika kala ha na kugola ng'odu fyadayilili bambu yula, datovangiwi nesu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Lakini yula yamanya ng'odu bambu waki fyadayila, ayu dateshiwi ngajila kumanya kwaki, datovangwi padokwa. Yamuvikilili fitangalili dapati fitangalili nesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nongwa ya kulekana vandu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 10:34-36</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>“Nyisa kukosha motu kumlima, ingavelili nyanyi ungayakili kala! <verse number="50" style="v"/>Ndina ubatishu ngudayiliwa kuupapa na dagobuleki mbaka mwishu! <verse number="51" style="v"/>Mkucha nyisa kuyegha kusika kumlima? Ng'odu kwahela kusika ila kuvalekanisha. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Na kufumila ponopa, kaya ya vandu muhanu davalekani, vatatu davalevi na vavili na vavili kwa vatatu, <verse number="53" style="v"/>tati dalevi na vana vaki valumi na mawu dalevi na vana vaki vadala, mkohanu dalevi na mdala wa mwana waki na ayu dalevi na mukamwana.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kumanya fipindi</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 16:2-3</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela kandi lipinga lya vandu, “Pamuwona mafundi pavafuma mwambu wa kuchanya, tepu mkucha ndonya dayitonyi na nakaka yikutonya. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Pamuwona likumba lya kalihingila likupula, mkudeta dakuvi na lijuva na yikuva wuwu. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Yumwi muvafyangu! Mkumanya kutunga ndambu panji kuveli kwa kulola ndambu ya mlima na kululanga, nongwa liki, mukulemwa kumanya mana ya fipindi afi?”</para>
  <para style="s">Mujovi na mlongu waku</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 5:25-26</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>“Nongwa liki mukulemwa kukanda mwaveni milandu minofu ya kugola? <verse number="58" style="v"/>Nongwa kucha muhigha waku akukuyegha kuhighiwa, yingavelili ngiba kwa yuwi mujovi pamuva mkali mudeha, ili akotoo kukuyegha kwa muhigha, mweni muhighi dakuyeghi kwa machonda, mweni davakutayi muchijaka. <verse number="59" style="v"/>Yina ngukuwombela dawufumi ng'odu amu, mbaka umalili kuhomba ligwala lyaku lya mwishu.”</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Musileki sambi awu mudanganyiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Chipindi achi vandu vamu vayisili vamuwombilili Yesu milandu ya vandu va Galilaya, Pilatu avelili kavawulagha chipindi pavaveghi vakugola mitambiku? <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu avawombilili, “Wuli mukuyihola vandu va Galilaya ava vaveli vavifya pitu Vagalilaya vamonga vosi, nongwa vagobuliwa nawula? <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nguvawombela ng'odu! Lakini mwaveni, pamupomela ng'odu, sambi shenu damupeli kucha veni. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Awu vala lilongu na vanani wuvawilili mnala kula Siloamu, vasova mukuyihola veni vavelili na sambi kupita vamonga vosi vayikalili Yelusalemu? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nguvawombela ng'odu! Lakini hata yumwi pamupomela ng'odu, damupeli kucha veni.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kucha likuyu lingajila kulela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu avawombilili chilangushilu achi, “Mundu yumu ayu avelili na likuyu muchitava chaki. Mundu ayu kayenda akadayileyi kunokola fivelekwa fyaki, lakini awonili lilela ha hata chivelekwa chimu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Topi amuwombilili mgolafichuku waki, ‘Loli! Kwa myaka mitatu yimelili ngwisa ngadayileyi kunokola fivelekwa fya likuyu ali, mbata chindu ha. Lidumuli! Nongwa liki uganga ukuyanangika hela?’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lakini mweni ayangulili, ‘Bambu, tulileki kandi mwaka awu, dandiwushengiteli kulima na kulivikila mboleya. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pamonga dalileli fivelekwa mwaka wuyisa awu, nyanyi, leki naha ng'odu, topi ukuwesha kulidumula.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlowola mawu yumu lijuva lya kupumulila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu avelili akuvawula munyumba ya kudadavila yimu mulijuva lya kupumulila. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Na apa pavelili na mdala yumu yavelili mtami kwa myaka lilongu limu na minani avelili na chinyamukela kamwingila. Kwa nongwa ayi, mvili vaki wavelili ugondama hata akulemwa kuwoloka chimimi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu pamuwonili, kamkema, kamuwombela, mawu utami waku wunana. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Amuvikilili mawoku na tepu mvili waki uwoloka kandi, kamjuma Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lakini mkomi wa nyumba ya kudadavila akalalili kwanongwa Yesu avelili kamlowola mawu ayu lijuva lya kupumulila. Topi kavawombela vala vandu vayisili pala, “Muvanawu majuva sita va kugola fichuku. Topi mwisi majuva ava avalowoli matami venu, lakini mukotoo kuyisa Lijuva lya Kupumulila!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Apa Bambu kayangula, “Yumwi vafyangu! Yumwi mukuvafuwulila vasenga venu awu vachihongu venu kufuma muligeleli mukuvayegha kulanda machi, hata mulijuva lya kupumulila. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hinapawu apa kuna biti wa uleli wa Ibulahimu, Lijangavandu amugolili ndevindevi kwa chipindi cha myaka lilongu limu na minani. Wuli yaveli nyanyi ng'odu kumfuwulila chifungu chaki lijuva lya kupumulila?” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Pamalilili kudeta afi, vala valimbaneyi nawu vawonili chindipa lakini vandu vosi vasekilili nendu kwanongwa ya milandu yosi yagolili.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuchaa mbeyu dokwa ya haladali</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 13:31-32, Maliku 4:30-32</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu avadashili, “Wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga wukuyifwana na liki? Daninganishi na liki? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yiva kucha mbeyu ya likuyu lyatolili mundu yumu na kukweta muchitava chaki, yamelili na kuva libiki. Vambongu vajenga miyumba yawu mumitafyi yaki.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kucha kimela</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 13:31-32, Maliku 4:20-32</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu adashili kandi, “Daninganishi wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga na liki? <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kucha mawu yumoyu yatolili chimela na kuhasha pamu na ukova madebi mavili na nusu pambeli ukova wosi uwumuka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mlyangu wa kuyikekeneka</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 7:13-14, 21:21-23</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu ayendilili na mwanja waki kuyenda Yelusalemu, kunu paapita mumbwani na mufijiji, palandula milandu ya Chapanga. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mundu yumu ayu kamdasha, “Bambu vandu davalowuliwi ndi vadokwa hela?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kavawombela, <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Mkamali kuyingilila mlyangu wunyepili, nongwa nguvawombela, vatangalili davayesi kuyingila lakini davalemwi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Chipindi dachiyisi mukola kaya datandamuki na kutata mlyangu. Yumwi damuwoloki panji na kukanda kuluva avafuwulili mlyangu, mukudeta, ‘Bambu, tufuwulili mlyangu.’ Lakini mweni davayanguli, ‘Ndivamanya ng'odu kumufumili!’ <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mwaveni damukandi kumuwombela, ‘Yufwi ndi vala twalili na kulanda pamu na yuwi na yuwi wawulili mufijiji fyetu.’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Lakini mweni dadeti, ‘Yumwi mfuma koti, muwuki pawushu yangu, yumwi mwavosi mwagolili sambi!’ <verse number="28" style="v"/>Apa dapavi na kulila na kugelijula minu, chipindi damuvawoni Ibulahimu, Isaka na Yakobi na vandundami vosi muwutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga, lakini yumwi vavadangila panji. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Vandu davayisi kufuma kundamba na kuchanya, kufuma kwavayighanji na kuyikala mulihungu kuwutwa wa Chapanga. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yina vala vavelili kumbeli, davavi kuulongolu na vala vavelili kuulongolu davavi kumbeli.”</para>
  <para style="s">Utami wa Yesu kwa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 23:37-39</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Chipindi chichila chila, Mafwalisayu na vandu vamonga vamuyendilili Yesu vamuwombela, “Wuki apa yendi mahali pengi, nongwa Helodi akudayila kukuwulaya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Muyendi mukamuwombeli yula chingekembi, ‘Nalelu na chilawu nguvinga finyamkela na kulowola vatami na lijuva lya tatu damalili chichuku changu.’ <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hata naha nalelu na chilawu na pawucha, lasima nyendileli na mwanja wangu, kwanongwa nyanyi ha mbuyi kuwulayiwa panji ya Yelusalemu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Yelusalemu! Yuwi Yelusalemu! Ukuvawulaya vambuyi na kuvaguma miganga vala wuvalayishili kwa yuwi! Myanja miningi ngadayileyi kuvavika pamu vana vaku kucha nguku vavafisa vana vaki pasi ya mbapatilu shaki, lakini valemili. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Topi, damlekewi nyumba yenu. Yina nakaka nguvawombela, damung'oni ha mbaka chipindi dachifiki damuwombi, Mumnemeli ayu yayisa kwa litawa lya Bambu.”</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlowola mundu yumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lijuva lya kupumulila limu, Yesu ayendili kulya filivi kaya ya mkomi yumu wa Mafwalisayu, vandu vavelili pala vavelili vakumlolesha. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mundu yavelili na utami wa kumema mawoku na mawulu ayisili kwa Yesu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu avadashili vawula va Malawu na Mafwalisayu, “Wuli Malawu vetu vakutujumisha kumulowola mundu lijuva lya kupumulila?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lakini veni vayikalili jii. Yesu kamkamula yula mtami, kamulowola, amulekili ayendi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pambeli kamuwombela, “Ghani wa yumwi yaveli na mwana waki awu senga waki padubukila mumyowu, angamuwushili ng'odu mulijuva lya kupumulila?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lakini veni valemili kumyangula pavadashili nawula.</para>
  <para style="s">Usangi na kuyidedeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Chilangushilu chila, Yesu avawonili vala vavalalikili pavayihaga pahali pa vakomi, kavawombela, <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Kucha mundu pakulalika kulihungu lya kuheta, ukotoo kuyikala pahali pa vakomi, pamonga kamlalika wingi mkomi pitu yuwi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Na mwenikaya wenu yumwi vavili dayisi na kuvawombela, ‘Mlekeli ayu chigoda.’ Apa dawuvi na soni kwa vandu vosi na dauyendi kuyikala kuchigoda cha kumbeli. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mani pakulalika kulihungu, uyikali kuchigoda cha kumbeli, pakayisa mwenikaya waku akuwombeli, ‘Ghanja, wisi kunu kuwulongolu, kuchigoda cha ukomi.’ Apa dawuvi kupata kufumala kumesu ya vandu vosi uyikalili pamu nawu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nongwa yoyosi yayikwesha dasunushiwi na yayisunusha, dakweshiwi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu amuwombilili na yula amlalikili, “Mani pauvakimbanikila vandu ndilya ya pamusi awu lumihi kotoo kuvalalika vaghanja vaku awu valongu vaku awu vajofi vaku vavelili valundamali, vakotoo kuyisa veni kukulalika umweni davakuhombi chila chivagolilili. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Badili yaki, paugola ndilya, valaliki vagaju, fikwavakwava, ndevindevi na vangalimesu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Na yuwi dawupati usangi, nongwa ava vahela cha kukuhomba. Nongwa Chapanga dakugayili fupa yaku Chipindi vandu goleki pavashukuka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kucha lihungu likomi</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 22:1-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yumu waa vala vavelili vayikalili pamu na Yesu adetili, “Kucha ngiba mundu yula daghalyi filivi muwutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu kamyangula, “Mundu yumu agolili lihungu likomi, kavalalika vandu ngenju. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Chipindi cha lihungu pachifikili amtumili ndumindumi waki akavalaliki vayisi, findu fyosi fiva kala. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lakini vosi, yumu yumu, vakandili kaluva avapomeli. Wakwaa kamuwombela mgolafichuku nenga hemela chitava, ponopa nguyenda kuchilola, ngukuluwa umbomeli. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Monga kadeta, ‘Nenga hemela vasenga lilongu wa kulimila, ponopa ndina mwanja nguyenda kuvayesha, deku umbomeli.’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kandi wingi kadeta, ‘Nguyenda kuheta mdala daweshi ng'odu kwisa.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Mgolafichuku ayu kawuya kumuwombela Bambu waki milandu yila. Yula mwenikaya akalalili, amuwombilili ndumindumi waki, ‘Lopukeshi yendi kudeha na mufijoku joku, uvayeghi munyumba amu vagaju, fikwavakwava, vangalimesu na ndevindevi vamonga.’ <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pambeli ndumindumi ayu adetili, ‘Bambu, milandu yigoleka kucha wung'ombili, lakini yikali hela fwasi.’ <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yula Bambu kamuwombela ndumindumi, ‘Yendi kudeha na kumbepitela sha kumbwani uvang'ang'aniki vandu vayingili ili nyumba yangu yimemi. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nguvawombela, kwa hela hata yumu wa vala avalalikili dayisi kulihungu lya nenga.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Kuva ndundami kutalama</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 10:37-38</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Apa lipinga lya vandu vatangalili vayikovikela pamu na Yesu. Topi kavaghalambukila vandu kavawombela, <verse number="26" style="v"/>mundu aweshi ha kuva mwanachuli wangu pangajila kundama nenga pitu vamtama tati waki, mawu waki, mdala waki, wavatama vana, valongu mundu valumi kwa vadala, hata kuyitama mweni, daghavi mwanachuli wa nenga ha. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mundu yatola ng'odu lupingika lyaki na kungovekela, daghavi mwanachuli wa nenga ha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Nongwa ghani Gati ya yumwi padayila kujenga mnala dayikali kukandila pasi agoli tolitoli, amanyi kanashu mbiya sha kumalishila? <verse number="29" style="v"/>Mani pakakanda lusiki, pambeli kalemwa kumalishila, vandu davamuseki. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Vakawombeyi, ‘Mundu ayu akandili kujenga, lakini kamalila ha.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Awu liki yavelili akudayila kuyenda kuyiminya na wutwa wingi, akudayiliwa ayikali tangila na kuyihola dawesi, kana machonda vaki lilongu alufu dalevi na yula yavelili na machonda alufu milongu mivili? <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kucha dawoni daweshi ng'odu, davalayishi vanjagila kudayila vayikali kwa kusika chipindi ayu mutwa mumonga akali hela kutali. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Wuwula wula, kwa hela hata mundu yumu pagati ya yumwi daghavi mwanachuli wa nenga, mani palekeshela ng'odu findu fyosi fyaveli nafyu.</para>
  <para style="s">Munyu ungali kunova</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 5:13, Maliku 9:50</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Munyu wa nyanyi, lakini pawusuka kunova kwaki dawuyigoli liki yikoleli kandi? <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yiva chindu ha, wala kwa miganga awu kwa mbolea, vandu davayiyasili kutali. Avelili na majeji na apikanishi!”</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Fungami yayaghamilili</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 18:12-14</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lijuva limu, vasumula mbiya na vavelili na sambi vatangalili vayendili kumpikanisha Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mafwalisayu na vawula va Malawu vakandili kung'ong'oleka, “Mloli mundu ayu! Akuvalalika vavelili na sambi, kunu akulya nawu!” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula kwa kuvawombela chilangushilu:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Muyenu yumu wa yumwi kava na vafungami mya, pawona yumu wa vala kayamila, dagoli liki? Davaleki vala milongu tisa na tisa kumidasi na kuyenda kumusaka yula yayaghamilili mbaka amuwoni? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pamupata, damupapi mumakombi kunu pasekilela. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pafika kaya, davakemi vaghanja mundu na kuvawombela, ‘Muyisi mulyi na kulanda pamu na nenga, kwanongwa ndimuwona fungami wangu yayaghamilili.’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kandi nguvawombela, dayivi cheleli buja kula kumbindi kwa Chapanga kwa mundu yumu yavelili na sambi papomela, pitu vala vandu milongu tisa na tisa yivayiwona goleki, vakudayiliwa ng'odu kupomela.</para>
  <para style="s">Ligwala liyaghamilili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Awu mukucha wuli? Tudeti mdala yumoyu kana migwala lilongu limu lya mbiya, payaghamisha yimu, dagoli liki? Dakwati motu na kufyayila munyumba na kuyisaka kwa unofu mbaka ayiwoni. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Payiwona, davakemi vaghanja vaki na vajofi vaki na kuvawombela, ‘Tufini, kwanongwa ndiliwona ligwala liyaghamilili.’ <verse number="10" style="v"/>Topi nguvawombela, dayiwi nahawu kwa makungu va Chapanga davasekileli kwanongwa mundu yumu avelili na sambi kapomela.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mwana yayaghamilili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu kayendelela kudeta, “Kwavelili mundu yumu ayu yavelili na vana vavili valumi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yula mdokwa kamuwombela tati mundu, ‘Tati, unyimbi mbala yangu.’ Na mweni kavaghanisha mali shaki. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Vapitili majuva vatangalili ha, kahemesha mbala yaki, ayendili na mbiya shapatili mlima wa kutali, aku ayanangili mbiya. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pamalishili findu fyosi, yafumbukili njala ngomi mlima wula na mweni akandili kughayanika. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Aluvili chichuku kwa mundu yumu wa kukula na mweni amuyeghili kufitava yaki kuvadima vangubi. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Adobukelili kulya mibandi ya filivi fya ngubi, kwavelili kwa hela mundu yamgayilili chindu ghalyi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Pakandili kupata luhala, kayihola, ‘Mbona kuna vagolafichuku vatangalili kwa tati wangu, vakulya na kufileka, kunu nenga ngusova njala? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Dang'uyi kwa tati wangu na kumuwombela, Tati, mifya kwa Chapanga na kwa yuwi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ukotoo kungema kandi mwana waku. Ugoli kucha mgolafichuku waku yumu.’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Topi akandili mwanja kuwuya kwa tati mundu.</para>
  <para style="p">“Paghaveyi akali kutali, tati mundu amuwonilili lusungu, kamtuvilila, kamukusikila na kumunonela. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mwana waki kamuwombela, ‘Tati, mifya kwa Chapanga na mifya kwa yuwi. Ukotoo kungema kandi mwana waku.’ <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lakini tati waki kavawombela vandumindumi vaki, ‘Mlopukeshi! Muyeghi yingwa sha nyanyi mukamfwalishi! Mumfwalishi peti na filatu! <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mumsinjili ngwada wa senga yanunili, tulyi na tusekileli! <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa ayu mwana wangu, yavelili kasova, kumbi munofu, yavelili kayaghamila, lakini ponopa kawoneka.’ Vakandili kulumbilila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Chipindi achi mkulu mundu avelili akali kufitava. Pawuyeghi, pafikili pabehi na kaya apikinishili filumbi na ng'oma. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Amukemili mvanda yumu, kamudasha, ‘Kuna liki?’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ayu mgolafichuku kamuwombela, ‘Mfwata waku kawuya kaya na tati waku kamusinjila ngwada yanunili kwanongwa kamupata kandi akali munofu.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Ayu kijana mkomi akalalili akalemeyi kuyingila munyumba. Tati waki kafuma panji na kumudedeveka ayingili. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lakini mweni kayangula, ‘Uloli, myaka yosi ngukugolela chichuku, ngalihela kulema Malawu vaku hata mwanja wumu. Kunyimba liki? Ukali hela kunyimba hata gwada yumu ngagoli lihungu pamu na vaghanja vangu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lakini mwana waku ayu yayanangili mali shaku kwa vadala vawoni, pawuyili hela kumsinjila ngwada yula yanunili.’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Tati waki kamuyangula, ‘Mwana wangu, yuwi kuva pamu na nenga majuva vonda na chimelili nachu ndi chaku. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Tukuyilata kugoli lihungu na kusekelela, kwanongwa ayu mlongu waku yavelili kasova, ponopa munofu, yavelili kayamila, lakini ponopa kawoneka.’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mgola fichuku msugu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu avawombillili vandundami vaki, “Mlundamali yumu ayu avelili na mgolafichuku waki. Mlundamali ayu vandu vamuwombilili, mgolafichuku waku akulya wafu mali shaku. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yula mlundamali amukemili yula mgolafichuku, kamuwombela, ‘Ayi milandu liki ya yuwi yimbikanisha? Unangushi tolitoli yiwugolilili mumali shangu, nongwa dawuvi kandi mgolafichuku wangu ha.’ <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yula mgolafichuku kayihola, ‘Bambu wangu damingimingi chichuku, dagoli liki? Kuyenda kulima ngulemwa na kuluva nguwona soni. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ponopa, manya cha kugola! Paminga chichuku, vaghanja vangu vaweshi kunibushila kaya yawu.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Topi kavakema vananongwa va bambu waki, yumu yumu. Kamuwombela yula wa kwaa, ‘Yuwi ukali hela kumuhomba ningi bambu wangu?’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mweni kamuyangula, ‘Ndeleku mya sha mafuta va miseyituni.’ Yula mgolafichuku kamuwombela, ‘Toli hati yaku ya kuhomba, Lopukeshi wikali, yandiki hamsini.’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kamdasha munanongwa wingi kandi, ‘Na yuwi ukali hela kumuhomba ningi bambu wangu?’ Mweni kamuyangula, ‘Mikanda mya ya mupunga.’ Yula mgolafichuku kamuwombela, ‘Toli hati yaku ya kuhomba, yandiki milongu minani.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Topi yula bambu kamjuma yula mgolafichuku muyananga mali kwanongwa avelili na luhunja. Kwanongwa vandu va mlimawu vanaluhunja mufindu fyawu pitu vala vandu va mulwengi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu kayendelela kudeta, “Nenga nguvawombela, mutoli mali sha mlima awu muyikoli lighanja na Chapanga leki pasipela damulibushilwi kungalilu ya jola. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yoyosi yaveli mwaminifu kwa milandu midokwa, daghavi mwaminifu kwa milandu mikomi. Yoyosi yangajila kuva mwaminifu kwa milandu midokwa, daweshi ha kuva mwaminifu kwa milandu mikomi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kucha yumwi mujumila ng'odu, kwa mali sivipili sha mlima, ghani davavapi sila mali sha nakaka? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Na kucha yumwi, vaaminifu ng'odu kwa mali sha mundu wingi, ghani davavapi mali shenu mwaveni?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Kwa hela ndumindumi yawesha kuvakimbanikila vabambu vavili kwa mwanja wumu, kwanongwa daamunyekwi yumu na kumtama yumonga, awu damukovikeli yumu na kumubedala yula muyaki. Muwesha ng'odu kumukimbanikila Chapanga pamu na kukimbanikila mbiya kwa chipindi chimu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Detelu yingi ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 11:12-13, 5:31-32, Maliku 10:11-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lakini Mafwalisayu pavapikanishili afi vamubedalili Yesu, kwanongwa veni vavelili vakusitama munu mbiya. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Topi avawombilili, yumwi mukuyigola muva vanofu kwa vandu, lakini Chapanga kasimanya ndima shenu. Nongwa chila chiwonikili kucha china ukomi kuwushu kwa vandu, Chapanga akuchiwona chindu ha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa na mayandiku va vambuyi va Chapanga vavelili na chichuku mbaka chipindi cha Yohani mbatisha. Kufumila pala chilongu cha nyanyi cha wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga chikulanduliwa na vandu vosi vakukimbanika kuyingila. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lakini yipusuka munu kumbindi na mlima kuyaghamila, pitu chilongu chidokwa mumayandiku va Malawu kuyaghamila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Yalekana na mdala waki na kumutola wingi akugola wuwoni na mundu yoyosi yamutola mdala yalekiwili, akugola uwoni.</para>
  <para style="s">Mlundamali na Lasalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Kwaveli na mundu yumu mlundamali mweni yavelili akufwala yingwa sitalamili na ayikalagha ngalilu ya chinaisa naisa majuva vosi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pamulyangu pa ayu mlundamali vamuyeghaya mgaju yumoyu litawa lyaki Lasalu, mweni aveli na filonda fitangalili vamuyeghili pamulyangu ya yula mlundamali, <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lasalu adobukelili filivi fiponikili pasi kufuma pamesa ya yula mlundamali, pambeli kwavelili vagalu vayisagha kumyanga filonda fyaki!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Pambeli yula mgaju asovili, makungu vamtola, vamvika pabehi na Ibulahimu kumbindi kwa Chapanga. Na yula mlundamali na mweni asovili, vamusika. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ayu mlundamali aveli kula kumambi pagobuleka, pabindulili mesu vaki, kavawona Ibulahimu na Lasalu kwa kutali. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Topi kamkema kwa lishu likomi, ‘Mbuyi Ibulahimu, ung'oneli lusungu, umlayishi Lasalu ajufiki chala chaki mumachi, aludoholi lulimi lwangu, nongwa ngugobuleka munu na awu motu!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Lakini Ibulahimu kamuyangula, ‘Wuvi na ngumbungumbu mwana wangu kucha wapokilili kala fya nyanyi, Lasalu apokilili fivipili. Lakini ponopa, mweni kafwama na yuwi ukugoboleka. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hata naha, pagati ya yufwi na yumwi kuna ligema likomi, vala vadayila kuyisa kwa yumwi kufuma aku valemwi na vadayila kufuma kwa yumwi kuyisa kwa yufwi davalemwi.’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yula mlundamali adetili, ‘Topi tati Ibulahimu, ngukudediveka umuwombeli Lasalu ayendi kaya kwa tati wangu, <verse number="28" style="v"/>nongwa ndina vafwata vangu vamuhanu, akavalandulili vakotoo kuyisa kunu kuvelili na gobuleku.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Lakini Ibulahimu kamuwombela, ‘Valongu vaku vava na Mayandiku va Musa na va Mbuyi va Chapanga. Valongu vaku uvaleki vavapikanishi ava.’ <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lakini mweni kavawombela, ‘Ng'odu Tati Ibulahimu, ila kucha mundu yasovili pashukuka na kuvayendela, davapomeli.’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ibulahimu adetili, ‘Mani pavavapikanisha ng'odu Mayandiku va Musa na vambuyi va Chapanga, davalilimuki ng'odu hata yumu angashukukili kufuma kumambi.’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Sambi</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 18:6-7, Mateyi 18:21-22, Maliku 9:42</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kavawombela vandundami vaki, “Findu fimugola mundu agoli sambi dafivi, lakini pishu kwa mundu yula mweni chambuja. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ingavelili ngiba mweni kumuwopela ligonguweli likomi mungulu na kumudubushila mulihiva, pitu kumuyambusha yumu va vananguta ava vagoli vifyu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Muyiloleyi!</para>
  <para style="p">“Mani mlongu waku pakuvifya, mukayiki, papomela, mjovi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mani pakuvifya myanja saba kwa lijuva limu na kuwuya kwa yuwi padeta, ‘Nenga mbomela,’ topi mpomeli.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ujumilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Vandundami vamuwombilili Bambu, “Tuyongisheli ujumilwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Bambu ayangulili, “Mani ujumilwa wenu ungavelili mdokwa kucha mbeyu dokwa ya likuyu, mungaweshili kuliwombela libiki ali lya likuyu, ‘Tupuki! Kameli kubahali!’ Na lyeni lingavajumilili.</para>
  <para style="s">Chichuku cha ndumindumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Lakini ghani wa yumwi yaveli na ndumindumi yalima awu yadima vasenga, pawuya hela kufuma kufitava, amuwombeli, ‘Lopukeshi, wisi, wikali wulyi filivi?’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Wuli! Damuwombeli ng'odu, kucha undandili filivi, ndilyi, wuyiwopi ungimbanikili, mbaka pandulyili na kulanda, topi na mweni aweshi kulya? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Wuli damulumbi ndumindumi yula kwanongwa kagola kala chichuku chamulayishili? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hata yumwi wuwowu, pamugolili kala fivavalayishili, mudeti, ‘Yufwi tuva vavanda vangajila fwayida, tugola hela fitudayiliwa kugola.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalowola vaveli na ukalava lilongu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu paghaveyi mumwanja kuyenda Yelusalemu apitilili Samaliya na Galilaya. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Payingileyi chijiji chimu, atanganili na vandu lilongu vavelili na ukalava, vawolokili kutali. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Vadetili kwa kulandusha, Yesu, Bambu, tuwoneli lusungu!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pavawonili kavawombela, muyendi mukayilangushi kwa mtambika.</para>
  <para style="p">Topi pavayendeyi vang'alili. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yumu wa vala pawonili kanana, kawuya kunu pakamjuma Chapanga kwa lishu likomi. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kayiyasilila pasi paulongolu pamawulu va Yesu kunu pakamuwombela Chapanga chikomu Bambu. Ayu avelili Msamaliya. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Apa Yesu kadeta, “Wuli vandu vang'alishiwili vavelili lilongu duhu? Vala vamonga tisa vawa koti? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Awonikili ng'odu mundu wingi kandi yawuyili kumgayila Chapanga ukomi, ila ayu mhenja weka hela?” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pambeli kamuwombela mundu yula, “Woloki uyendi, ujumilwa waku ukulowola.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kuyisa kwa wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 24:23-28, Mateyi 24:37-41</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Chipindi chimu Mafwalisayu vamudashili Yesu, “Wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga dawuyisi ng'odu?”</para>
  <para style="p">Mweni kavayangula, “Wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga dauyisi kwa ndambu ya kulembesha ha. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Wala kwahela daweshi kudeta, ‘Wuva apa!’ Awu ‘Wuva pala!’ kwanongwa Wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga wuva gati ya yumwi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pambeli kavawombela vandundami vaki, “Majuva davayisi damudobukeli kuliwona lijuva limu lya mwana wa mundu, lakini damuliwoni ng'odu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Vandu davawombeli, ‘Mloli, kawa pala!’ Awu, ‘Mloli, kawa apa!’ Lakini yumwi mukotoo kufuma wala kuvakovikela. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nongwa kucha wula lumuli paluwoneka lukung'alika kumbindi upandi wumu mbaka upandi wingi, dayivi kwa mwana wa mundu lila lijuva lyaki. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lakini dagobulewi tangila nendu na kulemiwa na ulelwa awu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kucha yivelili chipindi cha Nuhu, dayivi wuwu pavafika majuva va mwana wa mundu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Vandu vayendileli kulya na kulanda, kuheta na kuhetiwa mbaka chipindi chila Nuhu payingilili musafina. Lilava likomi liyisa na kuvawulagha vosi. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Dayiwi kucha chipindi cha Lutu. Vandu vayendilela kulya na kulanda, kuhemela na kuhemesha, kukweta mbeyu na kujenga. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lakini majuva vala Lutu pawukili Sodoma, motu na migonguveli ya motu dayitonyi kucha ndonya kufuma kumbindi na kuvawulagha vandu vosi. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ndambu dayivi majuva vala mwana wa mundu dalangushiwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Lijuva ali, yoyosi daghavi kumbindi ya lipaghali akotoo kusunuka kuyenda kaya kutola mali yaki na kucha mweni avelili kufitava akotoo kuwuya kumbeli kayaki. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mukumbuki yimupatili mdala wa Lutu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yoyosi yadayila kugombola unofu waki dayiyaghamishi mweni, na yoyosi yayaghamisha unofu waki dawugomboli. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nguvalongela, lijuva ali vandu vavili davavi vakuwonja pamu, yumu datoliwi na yula monga dalekiwi. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Vadadala vavili davavi vakushaya ukova pamu, yumu datoliwi na wingi dalekiwi.” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Vandu vavili davavi kufitava, yumu datoliwi na mumonga dalekiwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Vandundami vaki vamdasha, “Koti Bambu?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu avayangulili, “Pawuvelili mfimba na vandapu davayikungashi.”</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Chilangushilu cha ngalimlyangu na muhigha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Topi Yesu kavawombela vandundami vaki chilangushilu cha kuvawula kudadava kwa Chapanga ngajila kulepisiwa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kadeta, “Mbwani yimu yavelili na muhigha yamumanyili ng'odu Chapanga kandi kavahela luhunja kwa vandu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kumbwani kukula, kwavelili na mawu yumu ngalimlyangu mweni amuyendilili muhigha yula myanja yitangalili akamluveyi amtangi, pawomba, ‘Undangi mbati haki yangu kufuma kwa mdwama wangu.’ <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kwa chipindi chitali ayu muhigha akadayileyi ng'odu kumtanga ayu ngalimlyangu, lakini kumbeli kayiwombela, ‘Hata kucha nenga nimumanya ng'odu Chapanga na kuvabedala vandu, <verse number="5" style="v"/>lakini kwanongwa ngalimlyangu ayu ya nyasha dandimtangi, leki payendilela kunyasha, pambeli dandofyi nesu kunyisila majuva vosi!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Topi Bambu kayendelela kudeta, “Mpikanishi ndambu yadetili yula muhigha mwafu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Wuli ponopa Chapanga davatangi ng'odu vala yavashawulili, yivamlilila pamusi na pamihi, dalopukeshi ng'odu kuhigha highilu ya nakaka? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nguvawombela dalopukeshi kuhigha highilu ya nakaka. Hata naha, Mwana wa Mundu pawuya mumlima awu nakaka dawuwoni ujumilwa”</para>
  <para style="s">Chilangushilu cha mfwalisayu na msumula mbiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela kwa chilangushilu ngimu vandu vala yivavelili vakwiwona veni goleki na kuvabedala vayawu vosi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Kadeta, vandu vavili vayendili munyumba ya Chapanga kudadava, Mfwalisayu yumu na monga msumula mbiya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Ayu Mfwalisayu awolukili weka yaki padadava kunda yaki, ‘Ngudeta chikomu yuwi Chapanga, nenga ndiva kucha vandu vamonga ha, vapoki awu vadesi awu vawoni. Nenga ndiyifwana ng'odu na ayu msumula mbiya. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nguyikaja kulya myanja mivili kwa juma, saka ngutawula lilongu limu lya chimbata nenga.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Lakini yula msumula mbiya kunu kawoloka kutali kalemwa hata kuyinula mesu vaki kumbindi, ila akakamulili chifuva chaki kulangusha kushisha moyu, akadeteyi, ‘Yuwi Chapanga, ung'oneli lusungu nenga yimeli na sambi!’ <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nguvawombela, ayu msumula mbiya awuyili kaya Chapanga kamupomela sambi shaki lakini yula muyaki apomeliwili ha. Nongwa yayikwesha dasunushwi na yayidedeka dakweshiwi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvanemela vana vadokwa</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 19:13-15, Maliku 10:13-16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Vandu vamuyeghela Yesu vana vadokwa ili avavikili mawoku vaki. Vanachuli pavavawonili, vakavakanisheyi kwa filongu fikalipili. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu avakemili padeta, “Muvaleki vana ava vayisi kwa nenga, kandi mukotoo kuvakanisha, kwanongwa Wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga wuva kwa vandu kucha ava. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nguvawombela nakaka, mundu yoyosi yaupokela ng'odu wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga kucha mwana mdokwa, dayingili ng'odu Muwutwa awu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mlundamali</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 19:16-30, Maliku 10:17-31</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mkomi yumu Myawudi kamudasha Yesu, “muwula msangi, goli liki mbati unofu wa jola?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela “Mbona ukungema msangi? Kwahela mundu yaveli msangi ila Chapanga weka yaki. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Uvamanyi Malawu, ‘Kotoo kugola uwoni, kotoo kuwulagha, kotoo kuhija, kotoo kudeta udesi na uvatundamili tati waku na mawu waku.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mweni adetili, “Afi fyosi nifimanya kufumila wana wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu papikanishili fila, kamuwombela, “Kuna chindu chimu ukalihela kugola. Uhemeshi findu fyaku fyosi fiwuvelili nafyu, pambeli wuvagayili vagaju mbiya shaki, dawuvi na lusanja lwaku kumbindi. Pambeli wisi ungovikeli.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lakini mundu yula papikanishili fila, kang'ong'oteka nesu kwanongwa aveli mlundamali mkomi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu pamuwonili akung'ong'uteka nawula, adetili, “Yidindala munu kwa mlundamali kuyingila muwutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga! <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yipusuka munu kwa ndembu kuyingila muchilanga cha sasiya, pitu mlundamali kuyingila muwutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Vala vandu pavapikanishili afi, vadeta, “Ghani dalowoki?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu kayangula, “Fyalemwili mundu, kwa Chapanga fikugoleka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Petili kamudasha, “Na yufwi wuli? Tufileka findu fyetu fyosi tukukovikela!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Nakaka nguvawombela, mundu yoyosi yayilekili nyumba na mdala na Mlongu awu tati na mawu, awu vana kwanongwa ya wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Dapokeli fitangalili munu chipindi achi na chipindi chiyisa achi cha unofu wa jola.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akudeta myanja mitatu kusova na kushukuka kwaki</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 20:17-19, Maliku 10:32-34</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu avatolili vandundami lilongu na vavili, kavawombela, “Mpikanishi! Tukuyenda Yelusalemu na aku findu fyosi fyavayandikili vambuyi va Chapanga fimwiyilatili mwana wa Chapanga dafigoleki. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nongwa dahadishiwi kwa vandu vangajila kuva Vayawudi na veni davamuseki na kumuwombela milandu ya wafu na kumtemela mita. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Davamtovi na ndomondu na kumuwulagha, lakini lijuva lya tatu kufumila pasovili dashukuki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lakini veni vakamanyili ng'odu milandu ayi hata padokwa, vakavelili. Kavafifa nongwa ya filongu fila na vamanyili ng'odu Yesu fyadeteyi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumulowola ngalimesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 20:29-34, Maliku 10:46-52</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Chipindi Yesu paghaveyi pabehi na Yeliku, pavelili na mundu yumoyu ngalimesu kayikala munjila paluva. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Papikanishili lipinga lya vandu palipita avadashili, “Kuna chindu liki?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Vamuwombilili, “Yesu wa Nasaleti akupita.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mweni kayangula kwa lishu likomi, “Yesu, mwana va Dawudi, ung'oneli lusungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Vala vandu valongulili vakamlakalileyi anyamali, lakini mweni ayongishili lishu likomi, “Mwana wa Dawudi, ung'oneli lusungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu awolukili, kavawombela vamuyeghi pawulongolu yaki. Yula ngalimesu pafikili pabehi, Yesu amudashili, <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Ukudayila ngugoleli liki?”</para>
  <para style="p">Mweni ayangulili, “Bambu, ngudayila kulola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Loli! Ujumilwa waku wukulowola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Tepu yula ngalimesu akandili kulola, akamukovekeleyi Yesu kunu pamuwombela chikomu bambu Chapanga. Vandu vosi pavawonili nawula, vamjuma Chapanga.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Sakayu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kayingila mlima wa Yeliku, aveli papita mumlima wula. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pavelili mundu yumu litawa lyaki Sakayu mweni aveli mkomi wa vasumula mbiya na aveli mlundamali. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Akadayileyi kumuwona Yesu aveli wa wuliwuli, lakini aweshili ha kumuwona Yesu, nongwa lipinga lya vandu lyaveli likomi na mweni aveli kanduli. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Topi kalongola mbilu kakwela mulikuyu ili amuwoni Yesu nongwa dapitili deha yiyila yila <verse number="5" style="v"/>Topi Yesu pafikili pala, kalola kumbindi ya libiki kamuwona Sakayu, kamuwombela, “Sakayu sunuki kalopu, kwanongwa nalelu dandivi kayaku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Sakayu kasunuka kalopu, kamselilela kwa seku. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Vandu vosi pavawonili nawula, vakanda kung'ong'oleka vadeta, “Kayenda kuyikala kwa mundu yaveli na sambi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lakini Sakayu kawoloka, kamuwombela, “Bambu, pikanishi,! Nenga dandivapi vagaju nusu ya mali shangu na leki mundu yoyosi nimupokili chindu kwa kumujanga, dandimuwuyishili myanja mchechi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Nalelu ulowolu wufika munyumba ayi na kwa mundu ayu. Kwa nongwa ayu wuwowu mwana wa lukolu lwa Ibulahimu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa mwana wa mundu ayisili kusaka na kuvalowola yivayaghamilili.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mfwanu wa vandumindumi lilongu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 25:14-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Vandu pavapikanishili afi, Yesu kayendelela kuvawombela kwa filangushilu kwanongwa avelili pabehi na Yelusalemu na veni vakacheyi wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga wuva tepu kuwoneka. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Topi kadeta, “Mundu yumu mlundamali, awukili ayendili mwanja wa mlima wa kutali, ili vakamwingishi wutwa pambeli awuyili. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Topi padayileyi kuwuka, kavakema vala lilongu wa vala vandumindumi vaki. Kavapa kila mundu mbiya sha ijala ya myesi mitatu kavawombela, ‘Mgoleli uchulusi mbaka pang'uya.’ <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lakini vandu vaki vamunyekwili, vavalayisha vanjagila kumkovikela na kumuwombela, ‘Tukumdayila ng'odu mundu ayu ghavi mutwa wetu.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Pawupatili wutwa waki kawuya. Pambeli kavakema vandumindumi vaki ili amanyi fwayida ngomi yivapatili kila mundu muuchulusi waki. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ndumindumi wa kwaa kayisa, kadeta, ‘Bambu, ndisiyongesha mala lilongu ya sila mbiya siwunyimbili.’ <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kamuwombela, ‘Nyanyi, yuwi kuva ndumindumi mnofu! Kuva mwaminifu wa chidokwa na nenga dandikugoli kuva chiwongosi wa vayaku.’ <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ndumindumi wa pili kayisa, kamuwombela, ‘Bambu, siyongishekili siva myanja muhanu ya migwala ya mbiya yiwunyimbili.’ <verse number="19" style="v"/>Na yula kamuwombela, ‘Dawuvi mkomi wa milima muhanu.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Ndumindumi wingi kayisa, kamuwombela, ‘Bambu toli mbiya yaku yiyila yila. Ndayifisili muchitambala. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ndatilili kwanongwa yuwi kuva mundu mkali. Yuwi kuva mundu yiwutola chila chingajila kuvika na kunokola chila chiungajila kukweta.’ <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mweni kamuwombela, ‘Yuwi ndumindumi mwafu! Danguhighi kwa filongu fyaku! Wamanyili kucha nenga mundu mkali yidayila fingajila kuva fyangu na ngubena chingajila kukweta. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Topi mbona kuyivika ng'odu mbiya yangu kwa yivatawula fiyongishekili ponopa ningatolagha na nyongesha shaki?’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Topi kavawombela vala vavelili pala, ‘Mumpoki ayi mbiya, mukamupi yula yapatili nyongesha mala lilongu.’ <verse number="25" style="v"/>Veni vamuwombela, ‘Bambu, lakini ayu kana nyongesha ayi ya lilongu!’ <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mweni kavayangula, ‘Nguvawombela kila yangajila chindu, hata chila chaveli nachu dapokiwi. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Na ponopa, vala vadayilili ng'odu nenga ndivi mutwa wawu muvayeghi apa, ndivawulayi bahapa paulongolu yangu!’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akwingila Yelusalemu kwa filumbi</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 21:1-11, Maliku 11:1-11, Yohani 12:12-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu padetili kala afi, kavalongulela kuulongolu payenda Yelusalemu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Paghaveyi samba kufika Betifage na Betaniya muchidunda chivakema Miseyituni, avatumili vandu vavili vamu wa vala vandundami vaki, <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kavawombela, “Muyendi kumlima wuveli pawulongolu yenu, pamuyingila pala damumuwoni ngwada wa chihongu kakongiwa, yangajila kugolewa chichuku na mundu yoyosi, mumuwoposoli mumuyeghi apa.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="15 Colt.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="19:30">Ngwada wa chihongu</figure> <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kucha mundu pavavadasha nongwa liki mukumuwopusola mudeti naha, Bambu akumdayila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Vala vandundami vayenda, vawona wuwula wula ngimu wuvalayilili. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Pavamuwopusoleyi yula chihongu, veni vavadasha, “Nongwa liki mukumuwopusola chihongu ayu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Veni vavayangula, “Bambu akumdayila.” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Topi vamyeghela Yesu yula chihongu. Vayala yingwa shawu kumuwongu wa yula chihongu, vampakila Yesu. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu payendilelili mumwanja waki vayendagha kuyala yingwa shawu mudeha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Hata paghaveyi samba afika Yelusalemu, pamaleka va chidunda cha miseyituni, lipinga lyosi lya vandundami vaki vakandili kunemelela kwa filumbi na kumjuma Chapanga kwa lishu likomi kwanongwa fyosi fyagolili uwesu waki vawuwonili, <verse number="38" style="v"/>Vadeta, “Ayu yayisa ayu kwa litawa lya Bambu! Ndi yanemiliwili na Chapanga atugayili kusika aku kumbindi kwa Chapanga na ukomi aku kumbindi kwa Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Bahala pala Mafwalisayu vamu vavelili mulipinga lila vamuwombela, “muwula, wuvakayiki vandundami vaku vanyamali.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Nguvawombela nakaka kucha ava pavanyamala, migonguveli dayiviki chowu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuyililila Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Pafikili pabehi, ayiwonili mbwani ya Yelusalemu, Yesu kayililila. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Padeta, “Leki ungamanyili mulijuva ali yikudayiliwa kuvi kusika! Lakini ponopa yifisiwa uyiwoni ng'odu! <verse number="43" style="v"/>Nongwa majuva vakwisa, vachimdwama vaku davakujengeli liboma likushengiteli mbembi shosi, <verse number="44" style="v"/>Davakuwishi pasi yuwi na vandu vaku munyumba yaku, davakulekeli ha liganga kumbindi ya liganga, kwanongwa kumanya ha chipindi cha Chapanga chikwisila.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akwingila munyumba Ngomi ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 21:12-17, Maliku 11:15-19, Yohani 2:13-22</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Topi Yesu kayingila munyumba ya Chapanga, kakanda kuvavingila panji vachuwusi, <verse number="46" style="v"/>kavawombela, “Yiyandikiwa mumayandiku, ‘Nyumba yangu dayivi nyumba ya kudadavila.’ Ila yumwi muyigola yiva mbaku ya vefi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yesu aveli akuwula kila lijuva munyumba ya Chapanga, lakini vawula va Malawu na vayandika na vakomi va vandu vakasakeyi njila ya kumuwulagha, <verse number="48" style="v"/>ila vachiwonili ha cha kugola, kwanongwa vandu vavelili vakumkovikela na kumpikana filongu fyosi fyadeta.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Uwesu wa Yesu ufuma kwa ghani</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 21:23-27, Maliku 11:27-33</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lijuva limu, Yesu aveli akuwula vandu munyumba ya Chapanga na kuchilandula Chilongu cha Nyanyi. Vatambika vakomi na vawula va Malawu na vavaha vambwitukilili Yesu, <verse number="2" style="v"/>vamudasha, “Tuwombeli, ukugola findu afi kwa uwesu wa ghani? Ghani yakugayilili uwesu awu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Na nenga dandivadashi yumwi chindu chimu. Mung'ombeli, <verse number="4" style="v"/>ubatishu wa Yohani mbatisha wafumili kumbindi kwa Chapanga awu kwa vandu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Vayidasha veni kwa veni, “Kucha patudeta, ‘Wafumili kumbindi kwa Chapanga,’ dadeti, ‘Mbona mwamjumilili ha?’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Na patudeta, ‘Wafumili kwa vandu,’ vandu vosi davatugumi miganga kwanongwa vamjumila Yohani mbatisha kucha mbuyi wa Chapanga.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Topi vamuyangula, “Tumanya ha kuufumili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Na nenga ndivawombeli ha ngugola findu afi kwa uwesu wa ghani.”</para>
  <para style="s">Chilangushilu cha chitava cha misabibu na valimi</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 21:33-46, Maliku 12:1-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu kakanda kuvawombela vandu chilangushilu achi: “Mundu yumu yapandili misabibu mufitava, kavahadisha valimi, mweni kawuka kayenda kuyikala mlima wingi kwa majuva vatangalili. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Chipindi cha kubena, mundu ayu kamulayisha ndumindumi waki kwa vala valimi, akatoli fimu fya fyavabenili muchitava chila cha mizabibu. Topi vala valimi vamtovanga ndumindumi yula, pambeli vamuwuyisha mawoku hela. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yula mundu kamulayisha kandi ndumindumi wingi, lakini na ayu vamtovanga wuwula wula na kumjowola na kumuwuyisha mawoku hela. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kamulayisha kandi wa tatu, na ayu pavamteshili kala, vamuyasili panji ya chitava. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Topi yula bambu wa chitava chila cha misabibu kadeta, ‘Goli wuliwuli? Dandimtumi mwana wangu yindimtamili, ayu davamtili.’ <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lakini vala valimi pavamuwonili hela mwana wa muna chitava, vawombana, ‘Ayu ndi muhala mbala. Topi tumuwulayi ili mbala yaki yivi yetu.’ <verse number="15" style="v"/>Topi vamfumisha panji ya chitava cha misabibu, vamuwulaya.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kadasha, “Munachitava dagoli liki kwa vala valimi? <verse number="16" style="v"/>Dayisi kuvawulaya valimi vala na chila chitava cha misabibu davapi vandu vengi.”</para>
  <para style="p">Pavapikanishili afi vadeta, “Afi fikotoo kutuwona yufwi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Topi Yesu kavafulutulila mesu, kavawombela, “Topi mana yaki liki chilongu achi chiyandikiliwili.</para>
  <para style="q">Lusiki valulemili vajengi,</para>
  <para style="q">Luva lusiki lukomi lwa kwidumbila kupita shosi?</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mundu yoyosi yawila mulusiki lula dabeneki beneki, lakini mundu yoyosi palimuwila dalimbaji bajabaja.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kuhomba kodi kwa mutwa wa Loma</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 22:15-22, Maliku 12:13-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Vawula va Malawu na vatambika vakomi vakasakeyi njila ya kumuwomesha chipindi chichila chila, vavatilili vandu, nongwa vamanyili kucha chilangushilu achi chivayilata veni. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Topi vakamulembisheyi, vavalayisha valembesha vayigolili kucha veni vandu va haki ili vamuwomeshi filongu fyaki, pambeli vamukamuli na kumuyegha kwa vatavala na vanauwesu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Vala valembesha vamudasha Yesu, “Muwula, tukumanya ukudeta na kuwula milandu ya nakaka. Tukumanya yuwi kuna lushawu ng'odu. Yuwi ukuwula fya nakaka fya deha ya Chapanga.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Topi vamudasha, “Tuwombeli, yikujumishiwa kuhomba kodi kwa mutwa wa Loma awu ng'odu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu amanyili ufyangu wawu, kavawombela, <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Munangushi ligwala lyeni. Wuli wushu na lihundu lya ghani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Veni vayangula, “Ya mutwa wa Loma.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Fya mutwa wa Loma mumupi mutwa wa Loma na fya Chapanga mumupi Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Vawesha kandi ha kumuwomesha kwa chilongu chochosi pala pa vandu na vayikala kokota vakujinga nyangulilu yaki.</para>
  <para style="s">Milandu ya kushukuka</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 22:23-33, Maliku 12:18-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pambeli Masadukayu vamu, vala yivadeta yivasovili vakushukuka ng'odu kushukuka, vamuyendela, vamudasha, <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Muwula, Musa atuyandikilili kucha muna mdala asovili lakini amulekili mdala waki ngajila mwana, mdala yula atoliwili na mlongumundu, ili amuleleli vana mlongumundu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kwavelili na valongu saba. Wakwaa ahetili mdala pambeli kasova ngajila kuleka vana. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yula mlongu mundu wa pili kamuhala mdala yula na mweni kasova ngajila kuleka mwana. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hata mlongu wa tatu wuwula wula, mbaka vosi saba, vasova ngajila kuleka vana. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Pambeli na yula mdala kasova. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Topi lijuva lya kushukushiwa, daghavi mdala wa ghani? Nongwa vosi saba vamuhetili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Vandu va mlima awu vakuheta na kuhetiwa. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Lakini vala vavalangiwili kucha davawupati mlima wula na kula kushukuka kufuma munjifwa, vakuheta ha wala kuhetiwa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Davasovi kandi ha, kwanongwa vava telatela na makungu na veni vana va Chapanga, kwanongwa veni davashukuki. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kuna kushukuka pawusovili kala, hata Musa ayandikili afiwonili lijuva lila pamukemili Chapanga, kuva Chapanga wa Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobi, chipindi Chapanga kawombana nayu pala pamidasi payakeyi motu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Topi mweni kucha Chapanga wa vasovili ha, ila Chapanga wa vala vaveli vanofu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Vala vawula vamonga va Malawu vayangula vawomba, muwula kudeta nyanyi, <verse number="40" style="v"/>Vawuyila kandi ha kumudasha chindu.</para>
  <para style="s">Milandu ya Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 22:41-46, Maliku 12:35-37</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu kavadasha, “Yiva wuliwuli vandu vakudeta Kilistu Mkombola yashawuliwili na Chapanga ndi mwana wa Dawudi? <verse number="42" style="v"/>Dawudi mweni akudeta muchitabu chaki cha Sabuli,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Bambu amuwombilili Bambu wangu:</para>
  <para style="q">Wuyikali mwambu wa liwoku lyangu lya mlilu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Mbaka ndivaviki vachimdwama vaku vavi chipasa cha kuvikila mawulu vaku.’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Payiva Dawudi akumkema Kilistu ‘Bambu’, dayivi wuliwuli Kilistu Mkombola amukemi mwanamundu?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvakayika vandu kwa milandu ya vawula va Malawu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 23:1-36, Maliku 12:38-40</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Vandu vosi pavampikanileyi, Yesu kavawombela vandundami vaki, <verse number="46" style="v"/>Muyilyepi na vawula va Malawu veni vakudayilaya kuyendayenda kunu vafwala mihabiti mitali. Na kujambushiwa musoku na kuyikala kuulongolu munyumba sha kudadavila na kuyikala figoda fya kuulongolu mulihungu. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Vakuvapuhanya vangalimlyangu kunu pavayilyambishila veni vandu vasangi kwa Chapanga na kugola dadavilu ndali kwa Chapanga. Ava davapati highilu ngomi.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Chatawulili ngalimlyangu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 12:41-44</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kavawona valundamali pavatayeyi fupu shawu musanduku lya mbiya Munyumba ya Chapanga, <verse number="2" style="v"/>pambeli kamuwona ngalimlyangu yumu kadubushila mula migwala mivili midokwa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Topi kadeta, “Nguvawombela nakaka, mawu ayu mugaju kataya chaveli nachu chosi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Vandu vosi vatayili fupu shawu sifumili muulundamali wawu wuyongishekili, lakini mawu ayu mgaju, kataya chosi chaveli nachu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kadeta kubomuliwa kwa Nyumba ya kudadavila</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 24:1-2, Maliku 13:1-2</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Vandundami vamonga vaveli vakaywangeyi milandu ya nyumba ya Chapanga, ndambu yivamelimetishili kwa migonguveli ya nyanyi pamu na vivatawulili vandu, kadeta, <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Afi fyosi fimufiwona, lijuva daliyisi kwahela ligonguveli hata limu dalisighali pambindi ya ligonguveli limonga, migonguveli yosi ya nyumba dayidanganyishiwi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Tabu na kugoboka</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 24:3-14, Maliku 13:3-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Topi vamdasha, “Muwula, findu afi dafivi ndili? Datuwoni chindu liki dachitulangushi tanila?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Muyivavali, mukotoo kujangiwa. Vandu vatangalili davayisi kwa litawa lyangu pavadeta, ‘Nenga ndi Kilistu Mkombola yishawuliwili na Chapanga!’ Topi ‘Chipindi chifika!’ Mkotoo kuvakovikela veni. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mkotoo kutila pamupikana mugoha na chiyighayigha, nongwa afi lasima fibwituki tanila, lakini yila mbelu yikali hela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kavawombela, vandu va mlima wumu davawuki na kwiminya na vandu va mlima wingi na wutwa dawuyiminyi na wutwa wingi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Dakuvi na chiyighayigha chikomi mumlima na njala na utami wuvawukema tawuni mahali kosi na findu fya kukapusha na filangushilu fikomi kufuma kumbindi kwa Chapanga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lakini nguvawombela, fyosi afi ngajila tanila kubwituka, davavakamuli na kuvavifya na davavayeghi munyumba sha kudadavila na kuvawopa mufijaka, kwanongwa mukungovikela nenga. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Na ayi dayivi fwasi ya kuvalandulila Chilongu cha Nyanyi. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Topi muvi na chiganu mundima shenu, mukotoo kuyihola kucha damudeti liki, <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa nimweni dandivapi filongu fya kudeta na luhunja, hata vachimdwama venu davalemi ng'odu wala kulimba. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yumwi davavashengeti vatati na vamawu venu na valongu venu na vaghanja venu na davavawulayi vamu va yumwi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Vandu vosi davavanyekwi yumwi kwanongwa ya kungovekela nenga. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Topi nguvawombela kwahela hata lufwili lumu lwa kumutwi yenu daluyaghamili. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mugangamali, damuyikomboli mwaveni.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akudeta kubomuliwa mlima wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 24:15-21, Maliku 13:14-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Pamuuwona mlima wa Yelusalemu ushengitiwa na mangandawu, topi mumanyi kucha chipindi chifika cha mlima awu kubomuliwa. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Topi yaveli Yudeya atuvilili kufidunda, vala vavelili kuchidunda chila vawuki na vala vavelili kufitava vakotoo kuwuya kumlima wula. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nongwa majuva ava ndi majuva va highilu, ili fyosi fiyandikiwili figoleki. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Pishu vala vaveli na ndumbu na vala vayongesha majuva va mbelu. Kwa nongwa dakuvi na tabu ngomi mlima wosi na maya va Chapanga davavapati vandu ava. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Vamonga davawulayiwi kwa lipanga na vamonga davatoliwi mateka kumilima yosi. Mlima wa Yelusalemu davavatangiwi na vandu vangajila Vayawudi, mbaka fipindi fyawu pafipita.</para>
  <para style="s">Kwisa kwa Mwana wa Mundu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 24:29-31, Maliku 13:24-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Dakuvi na chilangushilu mulijuva na mwesi na ndondwa. Vandu va milima yosi davavi mutabu kwa nogwa ya kwipwelesha kuwumba kwa bahali na miwumbula. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Vandu davalepusiwi kwa kuyipwelesha na kwanongwa ya kulembilela findu dafiwupati mlima awu. kwanongwa findu fya kumbindi kwa Chapanga dafitikanyiki. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Topi apa ndi davamuwoni Mwana wa Mundu payisa mumafundi pamu na liwovi na ukomi utangalili. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Topi pamuwona findu afi fikubwituka, musakapuki, mukayinuli mitwi yenu nongwa ukombola wenu wuva pabehi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Chilangushilu cha likuyu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 24:32-35, Maliku 13:28-31</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kavawombela chilangushilu, “Muliloli libiki lya likuyu na mibiki yimonga yosi. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Pamuwona yikukanda kutomola mahamba, mukumanya kucha chipindi cha kukanda ndonya chiva pabehi. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Na yumwi wuwowu, pamuwona findu afi fikugoleka, mumanyi wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga vava pabehi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Nakaka nguvalongela, chileli achi cha ponopa dachipiti ha mbaka afi fyosi figoleki. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Lulanga na milima dafipiti, lakini filongu fyangu dafipiti ng'odu.</para>
  <para style="s">Mugungi mesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Muyikali ndemindemi, ndima shenu sikotoo kulemilela ubafu na unjayila na kuyifwasha na milandu ya ngalilu ayi. Lijuva lila tepu dalivabwitukili. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa dayivayisili kucha mtambu kwa wosi yivayikala mumlima awu. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Topi mugungi mesu majuva vosi, pamudadava ili mulowoki mufindu afi dafibwituki na kuwoloka paulongolu ya Mwana wa Mundu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Topi majuva vosi vala, pamusi Yesu aveli akuwula nyumba ya Chapanga na pamihi akuyenda kuwonja kuchidunda chivakemeyi cha Miseyituni. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Vandu vosi pamalavila puti vavelili vakuyenda kunyumba ya Chapanga kumpikanisha Yesu.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c"/>
  <para style="s1">Vayawudi vakusaka deha ya kumuwulagha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:1-5, Maliku 14:1-2, Yohani 11:45-53</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lihungu lya mibumbunda yingajila simika, livalikema Pasaka, lyaveli pabehi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Vatambika vakomi na vawula va Malawu vakasakeyi ndambu ya kumkamula Yesu kwa chifisu ili vamuwulaghi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yuda akujumila kumushengeta Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:14-16, Maliku 14:10-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Topi Lijangavandu kamwingila Yudasi, yivamkema Sikaliyoti, yumu wa vala lilongu na vavili. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pambeli Yuda kayenda kuwombana na vatambika vakomi na vala vamachonda va nyumba ngomi ya Chapanga ndambu ya kumutawula Yesu kwa veni. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Veni vasekilela, vajumila vamuhombi mbiya. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yuda ajumilili, akusaka fwasi nofu ya kumshengeta Yesu ili amtawuli kwa veni ngajila vandu kumanya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akukimbanika kutanda ndilya ya Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:17-25, Maliku 14:12-21, Yohani 13:21-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Topi lifika lijuva lya mibumunda yingajila simika. Ali lyaveli lijuva vanafungami va Lihungu vakusinjiwa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Topi Yesu kavalayisha Petili na Yohani kadeta, “Muyendi mukalitandi Lihungu ili tulyi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Veni vamudasha, “Ukudayila tukayitandi koti?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Mpikanishi! Pamuyenda kumbwani, damtang'aniki na mundu yayitwikili chiyungu cha machi. Mumukovikeli mbaka munyumba dayingili. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mumuwombeli mwenikaya wa nyumba yila, ‘Muwula akukudasha, chiva koti chumbagati cha mhenja dalilyi Lihungu pamu na vandundami vaki?’ <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mweni davalangushi chumbagati chikomi chitalishiwili kala. Muyitandi Pasaka amu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Topi vayenda, vafiwona findu fyosi filinganila ngimu wavawombilili Yesu, vatanda Lihungu.</para>
  <para style="s">Ndilya ya Bambu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:26-30, Maliku 14:22-26, 1 Vakolindu 11:23-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Saa payifikili, Yesu kayikala pamu na vandundami vaki vakulya filivi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kavawombela, “Bayulila munu kulya Lihungu ali ngengi pamu na yumwi chipindi ngali hela kugoboliwa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kwanongwa nguvawombela, dandulyi kandi ha Pasaka pamu na yumwi mbaka lijuva lila pandulya muwutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Topi atolili chikombi cha difwayi, kamulumba Chapanga, kadeta “Mupokeli muvaghani. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwanongwa nguvawombela nakaka, danandi kandi ha difwayi ya misabibu mbaka wutwa wa kumbindi wa Chapanga pawisa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pambeli katola libumunda, kamulumba Chapanga, kalimetula, kavapa vandundami vaki, kadeta, “Awu mvili wa nenga, wutawuliwa kwanongwa ya yumwi. Mgoli nga nahawu kwa ngumbungumbu ya nenga. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Wuwula wula palili kala, katola lwindi kadeta, lwindi alu ndi lilaghanu lya shonu lya mwasi wangu, wuumwayika kwanongwa ya yumwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Lakini mumuloli! Yula dashengeti liwoku lyaki dalitoti pamu na nenga! <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nakaka Mwana wa Mundu akuyenda kuwulayiwa kucha Chapanga ayilatili, lakini pishu mundu yula yamshengeta Mwana wa Mundu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Topi vakandili kuyidasha veni kwa veni mika ghani gati ya yufwi daweshi kugola chindu achi.</para>
  <para style="s">Ghani mkomi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Vandundami va Yesu vaveli vakulimbana, “Ghani mkomi gati ya yufwi?” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Vangajila kuva Vayawudi na vala yivavatavala vakuvakema vaveli na lighanja na vandu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ila yumwi mukotoo kugola kucha nahawu, yaveli mkomi kwa yumwi ghavi kucha mdokwa na daghavi ndumindumi wa vengi. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kwanongwa, ghani yaveli mkomi, yula yayikalili paghalya filivi, awu yula ndumindumi? Yina mkomi yula yayikalili pamesa paghalya. Lakini nenga kwa yumwi ndiva ndumindumi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Yumwi ndi msighalili na nenga chipindi chosi cha nenga kuyeshiwa, <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ngimu wula Tati wangu panyimbili wutwa na nenga wuwowu dandivapi yumwi. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Damulyi na kulanda pamesa ya nenga muwutwa wangu na kunu damuyikali mufigoda fya wutwa wa Chapanga kuvahigha makabila lilongu na mavili va Isilaeli.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akutunga Petili damlemi</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:31-35, Maliku 14:27-31, Yohani 13:26-31</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Simoni, Simoni! Pikanishi! Lijangavandu akudayila kuvalekanisha yumwi na wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga, akudayila avapeti kucha mpunga. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lakini nenga ngukudadavila, Simoni, ujumilwa waku ukotoo kuva. Na pawung'uyila nenga, wuvadindashi valongowu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Lakini Petili kayangula, “Bambu, nenga ndiva kala kuyenda pamu na yuwi hata pang'opiwa muchijaka awu kusova pamu na yuwi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kayangula, “Ngukuwombela, yuwi Petili, njowolu akuvika ha nalelu mbaka tanila yuwi unemi mala ndatu kucha nenga kumanya ha.”</para>
  <para style="s">Tuyitalishi na chipindi cha msayisayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kavadasha vandundami vaki, “Chipindi pandivalayilili muyendi mwavelihela mihaku wala mikanda wala mikobasi, mwayangilili na chindu chochosi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Vayangula, “Ng'odu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Ponopa nguvawombela naha, yaveli na muhaku awutoli na yaveli na likanda wuwowu na yangajila chimayi chikomi awuli lihabiti lyaki ahemeli upanga. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nguvawombela mayandiku yivadeta mweni dayivalangiwi pamu na vandu va wafu. Davawoneki kwa nenga nongwa fila fyavanyandikilili fivi nakaka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Topi vandumindumi vadeta, “Loli Bambu!” Apa pana mipanga mivili, Bambu Mweni kacha, fikwila.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akudadava kuchidunda chivakema miseyituni</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:36-46, Maliku 14:32-42</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu kayileka mbwani kawuka, kayenda mbaka chidunda cha miseyituni kucha wuchivelili chishovi chaki, ayilongushili pamu na vanachuli vaki. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Pafikili pala kavawombela, “Mudadavi mukotoo kuyingila munyeshu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Pambeli kawuka, kayikwegha kucha utali wa kudanga liganga naha, katundama kakanda kudadava. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Kadeta, “Tati, kucha pawudayila, ung'ushili lwindi alu, ila yikotoo kuva ngimu wudayila nenga, ila yivi ngimu wudayila yuwi.” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Makungu kufuma kumbindi kamfumbukila kamuyongesha liwovi. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Paghaveyi na lihingili likomi, kadadava kwa kung'ong'oleka na lifuki limsululeyi likaveyi kucha mindwesi ya mwasi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Padadavili kala, kavawuyila vanachuli vaki, kavawona vawonja, vavelili na lung'ong'u. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Kavawombela, “Mbona muwonja? Muyimuki mudadavi, mukotoo kuyingila mumayeshu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvakuliwa</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:47-56, Maliku 14:43-50, Yohani 18:3-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yesu paghaveyi akuywanga na vandundami vaki, lipinga lya vandu pamu na Yudasi Sikaliyoti yaveli yumu wa vala vandundami vaki lilongu na vavili kavalongulela. kamselilela Yesu, kamjambusha kwa kumunonela. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Yudasi, ukumshengeta Mwana wa Mundu kwa kumunonela?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Vala vandundami vaki vavelili pabehi pavawonili nawula vadeta, “Bambu, tuvatovi kwa fimayi fikomi?” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Muyawu yumu kamdula mvanda wa mtambika mkomi, kamudumula lijeji lya mlilu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kadeta, “Topi yikwila!” Kamugufya pamdumulili lijeji lya yula mvanda, linana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kavawombela vala vakomi va vatambika na va machonda va Nyumba ya Chapanga na vandu va Malawu na vavaha vala yivamwisilili, “Wuli, mwisa na mimayi na fimbongu kucha mukumkamula manyagha? <verse number="53" style="v"/>Majuva vosi patuveyi pamu na yumwi Munyumba ya Chapanga mwangamulili ng'odu. Lakini ponopa ndi ayi saa yenu ya liwovi lya wutwa wa chisi pawutavala.”</para>
  <para style="s">Petili akumlema Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:57-58, Maliku 14:53-54, Maliku 14:66-72, Yohani 18:12-18, Yohani 18:25-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Topi vamvakula, vamtola vayenda nayu mbaka munyumba ya mtambika mkomi na Petili amkovikelili kumbeli kwa kutali. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Pavakoshili kala motu pagati ya luviwu, veni vayikalili pamu na Petili ayikalili pasi pamu na veni. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Topi mvanda yumu mdadala kamuwona Petili kayikala mulung'ali, kamfulutulila mesu kadeta, “Na ayu avelili pamu na Yesu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Lakini Petili kalema, kawomba, “Yuwi mdadala, nenga ndimumanya ha mundoyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>Pambeli padokwa, mundu wingi kamuwona “Hata yuwepa yumu wa ava.” Petili kayangula, yuwi mundu, ndimumanya ha mundoyu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Pambeli kucha lisaa limu lipita, mundu wingi kamkamalila, “Nakaka hata ayu aveli pamu na Yesu, nongwa hata mweni wuwowu Mugalilaya!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Lakini Petili kadeta, “Yuwi mundu, nenga ndichimanya ha chiwudeta!”</para>
  <para style="p">Tepu, njowolu kavika. <verse number="61" style="v"/>Bambu kamughalambukila, kamulola Petili. Petili kakumbuka chila chilongu cha Bambu chadetili, “Kucha nalelu njowolu akali hela kuvika, dawunemi myanja mitatu.” <verse number="62" style="v"/>Bahala pala Petili kafuma panji, kalila munu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akudaniliwa na kuduliwa</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:67-68, Maliku 14:65</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v"/>Vala vandu vavelili vakumkamulila Yesu, vakanda kumdanila na kumdula. <verse number="64" style="v"/>Vamgubika kumesu, vakanda kumtova, Pambeli vamudasha dasha pavadeta, “Tungi ghani yakutovili?” <verse number="65" style="v"/>Na vamuwombela filongu fitangalili fya kumjowola.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vakuyeghiwa pawulongolu ya chitemela cha Vayawudi</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:59-66, Maliku 14:55-64, Yohani 18:19-24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Kukachi, Yesu kayeyiwa pachitemela cha Vayawudi. Pachitemela vavelili vavaha na vatambika vakomi na vawula va Malawu vatanganili pamu, vamuyegha pachitemela chawu. <verse number="67" style="v"/>Veni vadeta, “Tuwombeli, yuwi ndi Kilistu Mkombola yuwushawuliwili na Chapanga?”</para>
  <para style="p">Kavawombela, “Hata pandivawombela, damjumili ha, <verse number="68" style="v"/>hata pandivadasha, damunyanguli ha. <verse number="69" style="v"/>Lakini kukandila ponopa, Mwana wa Mundu daghavi kayikala mwambu wa mlilu wa Mweni Chapanga muna liwovi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>Vosi vadeta, “Yuwi Mwana wa Chapanga?”</para>
  <para style="p">Kavayangula, “Yumwi ndi yimudeta, nenga mweni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>Topi vadeta, “Tuva na haja liki kandi ya kusaka utovileli? Kwa nongwa tupikana filongu fyadetili kufuma mumlomu waki!”</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu muchitemela cha Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 27:1-2, 11-14, Maliku 15:1-5, Yohani 18:28-38</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Vatandamuka vandu vosi, vamuyegha kwa Pilatu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kula vakanda kumuhigha, pavadeta, “Tumuwona ayu pavifya mlima wetu na kuvakanisha vandu vakotoo kumuhomba mbiya Mutwa wa Loma, kunu padeta kucha mweni ndi Kilistu mutwa yashawuliwili na Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pilatu kamudasha Yesu, “Yuwi ndi Mutwa wa Vayawudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamuyangula, “Yina, ukudeta yuwi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pilatu kavawombela vatambika vakomi na lipinga lya vandu, nenga ndichiwona ha chindu chavifyili mundoyu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lakini veni vakamalila, vakawombeyi, “Davayashinganyi vandu, akuvajanga na kuvajongishela vandu vawulimbi mumlima Yudeya, kufumila Galilaya na ponopa kayisa kunu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuyeghiwa kwa Helodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pilatu papikanishili afi, kadasha, “Mundu ayu mwenikaya wa Galilaya?” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pamanyili kucha Yesu aveli pasi ya wutwa wa Helodi, amuyeghili kwa Helodi, nongwa chipindi achi aveli Yelusalemu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Helodi pamuwonili Yesu asekililili munu, kwanongwa amusakeyi majuva vatangalili kwanongwa apikanishili filongu fyaki, akushuvilila kuwona mihilu yigoliwili na mweni. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Topi kamudasha filongu fitangalili, lakini mweni kayangula chindu ha. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Vatambika vakomi na vawula va Malawu vawoloka vamuhigha nesu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Topi Helodi kamugola mundu msosuvafu, vamachonda vaki, vamudanila Yesu, pambeli vamufwalisha yingwa ya wutwa, vamuyegha kwa Pilatu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Topi Helodi na Pilatu lijuva lilila lila vava lighanja kwanongwa majuva va kumbeli vavelili vachimdwama veni kwa veni.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuhighiwa njifwa</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 27:15-26, Maliku 15:6-15, Yohani 18:39-19:16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Topi Pilatu kavakema vatambika vakomi na fiwongosi pamu na vandu vamonga, <verse number="14" style="v"/>kavawombela, “Mumuyegha mundu ayu kwa nenga muwomba akuvayaghamisha vandu na kuvajongishela na akulimba Wutwa wa Loma. Ponopa mpikanishi! Nenga namula filongu fyaki paulongolu yenu, ila ng'ona kucha kavifya chindu ha kwa filongu afi fimumuhighili. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kandi nenga weka hela ha, hata Helodi kamuwuyisha kwa yufwi kamuwona kavahela chindu cha wafu chagolili mbaka chimgoli ahighiwi njifwa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ponopa, alatuliwi fiboku, pambeli ngumlekishela.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Majuva vosi va lihungu lya Pasaka, Pilatu aveli na chishovi cha kumulekishela mundu yumu kufuma muchijaka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lakini vosi vawutilili pamu, “Muwulayi ayu, wutufuwulili Balaba!” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Balaba aveli mundu yawopiwili muchijaka kwanongwa ya kugola ndilingu mumbwani na kuvawulagha vandu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pilatu aywangili nawu mwanja wa pili, kwanongwa akadayileyi kumlekishela Yesu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lakini veni vadeta kwa lishu likomi, “Mvangilili mulupingika! Mvangilili mulupingika!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pilatu kavawombela mwanja wa tatu, “Kwanongwa liki? Ayu kagola chindu liki cha wafu? Nenga ndichiwona ha hata chindu chimu cha wafu chimugoli awulayiwi. Topi pandimlatula kala dandimlekisheli awuki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lakini veni vadeta kwa mashu makali, “Avangiliwi mulupingika!” Mashu vawu vaweshili. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Topi Pilatu kahigha kucha wuvadayilili veni yigoleki. <verse number="25" style="v"/>kavagayila Yesu yawopiwili muchijaka kwanongwa ya ndilingu na njifwa sha vandu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvangiliwa mulupingika</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 27:32-44, Maliku 15:21-32, Yohani 19:17-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Pavaveghi vakumuyegha, vatanganikili na mundu yumu yakemiwa Simoni wa mlima wa Kileni, avelili akufuma kufitava. Topi vamvakula, vampapisha lupingika badili ya Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Lipinga likomi lya vandu vamkovekela, kwavelili na vadadala yivavelili vakwinyanyanda na kumlilila Yesu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu kavaghalambukila, kavawombela, “Yumwi vadadala va Yelusalemu! Mkotoo kunilila nenga, muyilili mwaveni na vana venu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kwanongwa, majuva vakwisa, davadeti, Ngiba Vadadala vavelili vawumba na vaveli mbendi na vangajila kuyongesha. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Chipindi achi, vandu davakandi kufiwombela fidunda, ‘Tuwili!’ na midunda mikomi, ‘Mtugubiki!’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Leki vandu vakuligolela libiki lidodi nahau, dayivi wuliwuli kwa libiki liyumu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Vavatolili vandu vamonga vavili, vananongwa, vavawulaghi pamu na mweni. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Pavafikili mahali vapakema “Lipava lya mutwi”, pamuvangililili mulupingika Yesu pamu na vala vananongwa vavili, yumu mwambu wa mlilu na monga mwambu vaki wa mkiyi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu adetili, “Tati, vapomeli ava vamanya ng'odu chivagola.”</para>
  <para style="p">Vavaghana yingwa shaki, kwa kugola do. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Vandu vawolukili pala pavalola. Na vatavala vakamdanileyi vakawombeyi, “Kavalowola vamonga, ponopa ayilowoli mweni, kucha mweni Kilistu yashawuliwili na Chapanga!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Vamachonda wuwowu vakamdanileyi, vayendili kumupa siki. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kunu pavadeta, “Leki yuwi kuva mutwa wa Vayawudi, wuyilowoli umweni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Pambindi ya lupingika pavelili payandikiwa naha: “Ayu ndi Mutwa wa Vayawudi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yumu wa vala vandu va wafu vatumbikili kamujowola Yesu, kadeta. Nakaka yuwi kuva Kilistu! Wuyilowoli umweni na yufwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Lakini yula mundu mpoki wa pili, kamuyangula mumonga kadeta, “Yuwi ukumtila ng'odu Chapanga? Na yuwi kuva muhighilu yiyi duhu? <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yufwi tukuyanga ijala yetu kwa fila fitugolili, ila mundu ayu kagola chindu cha wafu ha.” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Pambeli kadeta, “Yuwi Yesu, ungumbuki nenga pawuva muwutwa waku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu kamuyangula, “Nakaka ngukuwombela nalelu dawuvi pamu na nenga kumbindi paladisu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akusova mulupingika</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 27:45-56, Maliku 15:33-41, Yohani 19:28-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Topi lwisa lwakandili kuyingila mlima wosi, kwaveli chisi mlima wosi kufuma pamusi saa sita mbaka saa tisa, <verse number="45" style="v"/>kwanongwa lijuva lyalekili kuvala, pambeli lupayi luvatumbikili munyumba ya Chapanga lwademukili filepa fivili. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesu alilili kwa lishu likomi, kadeta, “Tati, mumawoku vaku nguwuvika Mfuki wangu.” Pamalilili kudeta afi, kasova.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Topi mkomi wa machonda wa Valoma pawonili fimfumbukilili, kamjuma Chapanga kadeta, “Nakaka ayu aveli mundu munofu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Vandu vosi vavelili vayikungula pala kulola filongu fila, pavafiwonili pafigoleka, vawuka vayenda kayawu, pavayitova tova mufifuva kwa lusungu. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Vala vosi vamumanyili Yesu vawolukili kutali pavalola na vala vadadala vayilongushili pamu kufuma Galilaya, vawolukili kwa kutali pavalola findu afi.</para>
  <para style="s">Chikongu cha Yesu chikuvikiwa musembi</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 27:57-61, Maliku 15:42-47, Yohani 19:38-42</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Kwavelili na mundu yumoyu litawa lyaki Yosefu, yavelili mundu wa chitemela cha Vayawudi na aveli mundu msangi na mundu yagola fyadayila Chapanga, mwenikaya wa kaya yimu ya Vayawudi yivayikemaya Alimataya. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Mweni ajumilili ng'odu chilongu na chindu chila chivagolili na mweni aveli mundu wa Alimataya wuwu, mbwani yimu ya Vayawudi, kandi avetileyi wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga, <verse number="52" style="v"/>Topi mweni ayendili kwa Pilatu, kamuluva amupi Chikongu cha Yesu. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Pambeli kasunusha chikongu chila kufuma mulupingika na kawushengiteshela ligubiku lya yingwa yitalamili, kawuvika musembi yivasongulili muligangachuma livelili likalihela kusikiwa. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Lyavelili lijuva lya ljumaa lumihi chipindi lijuva lya kupumulila lyaveli likali hela kukanda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Vala vadadala vayilongushili na Yesu kufuma Galilaya vayendili pamu na Yosefu, kulola sembi na ndambu chikongu cha Yesu pachivikiwili. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Vawuya kaya, vatanda mafuta va kunungilila pamu na mafuta vengi yivavakema malihamu.</para>
  <para style="p">Na lijuva lya kupumulila vapumulili ngimu Malawu yivadeta.</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kushukuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 28:1-10, Maliku 16:1-8, Yohani 20:1-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Payifikili lijuva lya kupumulila, pamalavila puti puti, vala vadadala vayendili kula kusembi vatolili mafuta va kunungilila vala yivatandili. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pavafikili vawona lila ligonguveli libilibishiwa kumbali ya sembi.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="16 Tomb.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="24:2">Ligonguveli libilibishiwa pambali ya sembi</figure> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pavayingilili mugati, vauwona ha mvili wa Bambu Yesu, <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pavaveghi vakali vakwikanganika kucha ghani yabilibishili lila ligangachuma, tepu vandu vavili vawolukili pabehi na veni, vafwala yingwa sing'alili mbuletee! <verse number="5" style="v"/>Topi chipwembwi chavakolili na kugondama mbaka pasi, vala vandu vavawombela, “Kwanongwa liki mukumsaka mundu munofu pagati ya vandu vafwili? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kava baha ng'odu, kashukuka. Muvi na ngumbungumbu fyavawombilili paghaveyi kula Galilaya: <verse number="7" style="v"/>‘Mwana wa Mundu lasima akamuliwi mumawoku va vandu vaveli na sambi na kuvangiliwa mulupingika na lijuva lya tatu dashukuki.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Topi vadadala vala vakumbukili filongu fyaki. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Vawuka kula kusembi, vawuya vavawombela vala vandundami vaki lilongu na yumu pamu na vandu vamonga findu fyosi vafiwonili. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Vadadala yivavawombilili vandundami, vaveli Maliya Magadalena na Yoana na Maliya mawaki Yakobi na vala vadadala vamonga vavelili pamu, <verse number="11" style="v"/>Vandundami vayiholili fila filongu fyavawombilili vadadala vala fya upufi hela, vavajumilili ha. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lakini Petili kafuma, kayenda mbilu mbaka kula kusembi. Kagondama kushungulila mugati, kaliwona ligubiku hela. Kawuya kaya kunu payikang'anika milandu yila yayiwonili.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akwilangusha kwa vandundami vavili</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 16:12-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lijuva lilila lila, vandundami vavili va Yesu vakayendeyi kaya yimu yivayikema Emawu, yiva utali wa mwanja wa masaa mavili kufuma Yelusalemu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Vavelili vakuywanga fila fyosi yififumbukili. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pavaveghi vakuywanga na kuyidasha, Yesu mweni kavafumbukila kayendayenda pamu na veni. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Vamuwona kwa mesu vawu lakini vamumanyili ha. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu kavadasha, “Chimuywanga liki kunu pamuyendayenda?”</para>
  <para style="p">Vawoloka padokwa, vanyamala jii, kuwushu yawu kwakikinalili kwa lihingili. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Muyawu yumu yivamkema Kiliopa, kamdasha, “Wuli yuwi Yelusalemu apa muhenja, kufimanya ng'odu fifumbukili apa majuva ava va pabehi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mweni kavadasha, “Milandu liki?”</para>
  <para style="p">Vandu vala vayangula, “Yimufumbukilili Yesu wa Nasaleti, mundu ayu aveli mbuyi wa Chapanga muna uwesu wa kugola na kudeta pawulongolu pa vandu vosi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Vatambika vakomi na vatavala vetu vamutawula ahighiwi njifwa, pambeli avangiliwi mulupingika. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yufwi tukashuvilileyi daghavi mkombola wa mlima wa Isilaeli. Lakini nalelu lijuva lya tatu kukandila figoleki findu fyosi afi. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Vadadala vamonga va kayetu pamalavila puti puti vayendili kusembi, vatulilimusha pavatuwombilili, <verse number="23" style="v"/>vawuwona ha mvili waki, vawuya vadeta avafumbukilili makungu kavawombela kava munofu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Vayetu vamonga vayendili kusembi vawonili wuwula kucha vala vadadala wuvadetili, vamuwona ha Yesu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Mbona muva vapufi nahawu na yimuvelili na ndima sidindalili singajila kujumila fyosi fivadetili vambuyi va Chapanga! <verse number="26" style="v"/>Wuli, yamwilatili ng'odu Kilistu mkombola yashawuliwili na Chapanga kugoboliwa ngimu nawula na kuyingila muukomi waki?” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kakanda Kuhimulila milandu yosi yimwilatili mweni mumayandiku vang'alili kukandila Musa mbaka vambuyi va Chapanga vosi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Vachiselilela chila chijiji chivaveyi vakuyenda na mweni agolili kucha akudayila kuyenda kuulongolu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lakini veni vamdedivekili vawomba, “Wikali pamu na yufwi, nongwa lijuva liseneka na lumihi lwa pabehi.” Topi kayingila kaya yila, kayikala pamu na veni. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Pavayikalili pamu mundilya, atolili libumunda kalinemela, kalimetula, kavapa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Tepu mesu vawu vafuwuka, vamumanya, lakini pambeli kavayaghamila. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Vayiwombela, wuli! ndima shetu siyaka ng'odu mugati yetu paghaveyi akuwombana na yufwi mudeha na kutugubutulila Mayandiku?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Vawuka saa yiyila yila vawuya Yelusalemu, vavawona vala vandundami lilongu na yumu vatanganika pamu na vala vamonga vavelili nawu, <verse number="34" style="v"/>Vadeta, “Bambu nakaka kashukuka, kamfumbukila Simoni!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Vala vandundami vavili vavawombela milandu yosi ya findu fila fya munjila na ngimu wamanyikili kwa veni pala pametuleyi libumunda.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvafumbukila vandundami vaki</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 28:16-20, Maliku 16:14-18, Yohani 20:19-23, Mateyi 1:6-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Pavaveghi vakudeta milandu ayi. Tepu, Yesu kawoloka gati na gati yawu, kavawombela “Kusika kuvi na yumwi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Valilimuka na vatila vakacheyi vachiwona chishuka. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Lakini mweni kavawombela, nongwa liki mukuyipwelesha? <verse number="39" style="v"/>Muloli mawoku na mawulu vangu, nimweni nenga. Munembeshi muloli kwanongwa chishuka chivahela mvili na mipava yimelinayu kucha yimuyiwona kwa nenga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Padetili kala fila, pambeli kavalangusha mawoku na mawulu vaki. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Topi pavaveghi vakalihela kujumila, vaveli na luseku nendu kunu pavajinga, avawombilili. Apa muna filivi chochosi chila cha kulya? <verse number="42" style="v"/>Vamupa chipandi cha somba chikalangiwili. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Kachitola, kalya, pavamlola.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Pambeli kavawombela, “Afi ndi filongu fyangu findivawombilaya pandiveyi pamu na yumwi, kucha, lasima figoleki fyosi fivayandikili Mumalawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa, vambuyi na sabuli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Yesu pavavafuwulili luhala lwawu vamanya mayandiku. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Kilistu, ngimu wuvadetili kucha dateshiwi na lijuva lya tatu dashukuki. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Na vandu va milima yosi davalanduliwi kwa litawa lyaki chilongu cha kupomela na ng'ushilu ya sambi, kukandila Yelusalemu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yumwi ndi vatovilela va filongu afi. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Mpikani dandivayegheli yula Tati ajangili kumlayisha, lakini muyikali mumbwanemu, mbaka mupati liwovi kufuma kumbindi kwa Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu katoliwa kumbindi kwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 16:19-20, Figoli 1:9-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Kavalongosha panji ya mbwani kuyenda Betaniya, kayinula mawoku vaki kuvanemela. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Pavanemilili kala, kavaleka, Yesu katoliwa kumbindi kwa Chapanga. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Vamujuma, pambeli vawuyili Yelusalemu kunu vava sekuseku nendu. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Vayikala chipindi chosi mungengileka ya nyumba ya Chapanga kunu pavamjuma Chapanga.</para>
</usx>
